"id": "44da0ece-2b4c-400c-b3f1-72635238b12e", "place":{"id": "78007c5c-0e02-4b1b-b364-86bfedf1ba99", "name": "Circus Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "2a8fa9ce-b0d9-4bea-afb1-e07efd0211de", "name": "Lecture/Performance presence", "name_EN":"Lecture/Performance presence", "color": ""}, "name": "Bring emotions into your performance", "name_EN": "Bring emotions into your performance", "name_Secondary": "K'mila Sedtra", "description": "IG: @k_sedtra, Co sebou: Sebe\r\nPřijďte se naučit, jak přivést emocionalitu na jeviště proniknutím do zábavného spektra emocí! Prostřednictvím her a cvičení prozkoumáme, jak vyjadřovat emoce realističtějším a poutavějším způsobem, jak je vnést do vašeho pohybu a objevit mnohé stránky emocionální složitosti. Budete odcházet nejen s nástroji, aby vaše vystoupení byla plná srdce, ale také s nástroji, které můžete uplatnit ve svém každodenním životě.", "description_EN": "IG: @k_sedtra, What to bring: Yourself\r\nCome learn how to bring emotionality to the stage by tapping into the fun spectrum of emotions! Through games and exercises we’ll explore how to express emotions in a more realistic and relatable way, bring them into your movement and discover the many sides of emotional complexity. You will leave not only with tools to make your performances full of heart, but also tools that you can apply to your day-to-day life.", "start": "2025-08-14T13:30:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-14T15:00:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "78007c5c-0e02-4b1b-b364-86bfedf1ba99", "typeId": "2a8fa9ce-b0d9-4bea-afb1-e07efd0211de", "tags": [{"id": "35f1e8bc-7735-43fb-8caa-5d87e940a8b3", "name": "Masterclass", "name_EN":"Masterclass"}]
},{
"id": "4517fead-de94-4c36-9d26-8404d89c4072", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "64f26ee0-a3e5-422f-9a69-145c81e2d1b9", "name": "ALL PROPS", "name_EN":"ALL PROPS", "color": ""}, "name": "Expand your flow with movement games", "name_EN": "Expand your flow with movement games", "name_Secondary": "Carmen Perpetuum", "description": "IG: @perpetuum_flow, Co sebou: Sada poi, ropedart a/nebo kontaktní personál\r\nJak můžeme jako umělci proudění zlepšit svůj pohyb? Prostřednictvím hravého zkoumání zjistíme, čeho jsou naše těla schopna, a přijmeme neočekávané. Tento workshop s rekvizitami na všech úrovních spojuje principy pohybové kultury s flow arts, čerpá poznatky z disciplín, jako jsou bojová umění a tanec, a rozšiřuje možnosti pohybu. Prostřednictvím zábavných pohybových her, partnerské práce a zkoumání založeného na rekvizitách odemkneme nové cesty v těle, zdokonalíme svůj tok a prohloubíme vnitřní vědomí – beze strachu, že to uděláme špatně! Naše zaměření: páteř, rovnováha a práce nohou – vážná témata, ale vše o zábavě. (Inspirováno Crazy Monkey Movement Amsterdam a cvičením Fighting Monkey.)", "description_EN": "IG: @perpetuum_flow, What to bring: A set of poi, ropedart and/or a contact staff\r\nHow can we, as flow artists, enhance our movement? Through playful exploration, we’ll discover what our bodies are capable of and embrace the unexpected. This all-levels, all-props workshop blends movement culture principles with flow arts, drawing insights from disciplines like martial arts and dance to expand movement possibilities. Through fun movement games, partner work, and prop-based exploration, we’ll unlock new pathways in the body, refine our flow, and deepen internal awareness—without fear of doing it wrong! Our focus: spine, balance, and footwork—serious themes, but all about having fun. (Inspired by Crazy Monkey Movement Amsterdam & Fighting Monkey practice.)", "start": "2025-08-15T10:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T12:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "64f26ee0-a3e5-422f-9a69-145c81e2d1b9", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
},{
"id": "4525f59d-1bf3-4165-b831-e2474069f9c9", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "flowar.chitect.ts", "name_EN": "flowar.chitect.ts", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Julia je sama umělkyně ohně, takže přesně ví, co pohání náš proud!\r\nSvou DJskou cestu začala v loňském roce a již rozzářila pódia na Deep Camp, Fusion Festival a European Juggling Convention v Ovaru.\r\nJejí zvuk mísí melodický dubstep s psychedelickým trapem, poháněný hlubokými basovými linkami a působivými breakbeaty – zaručeně udrží vysokou energii a oheň.", "description_EN": "Julia is a fire artist herself, so she knows exactly what fuels our flow!\r\nShe began her DJ journey last year and has already lit up stages at Deep Camp, Fusion Festival, and the European Juggling Convention in Ovar.\r\nHer sound blends melodic dubstep with psychedelic trap, driven by deep basslines and punchy breakbeats — guaranteed to keep the energy high and fire burning.", "start": "2025-08-14T23:00:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T00:30:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []
},{
"id": "457379c1-9888-4681-b808-bb34891c59e4", "place":{"id": "0a759b58-84dc-46c3-9833-4a1c4b80b84c", "name": "Aerial Dome", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "805ca0a6-de05-4fee-a0ea-61602e8a2559", "name": "Aerial", "name_EN":"Aerial", "color": "#92CBFF"}, "name": "Aerial dance flow", "name_EN": "Aerial dance flow", "name_Secondary": "Tereza Oršulíková", "description": "IG: @terraaqabal, Co sebou: pohodlné těsné oblečení\r\nAerial dance flow spojuje sílu a jemnost, kreativitu s fyzickými výzvami, pochopení funkčnosti těla s elegancí a grácií. Vyzkoušíme neobvyklé techniky a triky se zaměřením na přirozený tok pohybu, autentický výraz a zdravý pohyb.", "description_EN": "IG: @terraaqabal, What to bring: comfy tight clothes\r\nAerial dance flow combines strength and softness, creativity with physical challenges, understanding the funcionality of the body with elegance and grace. We will try unusual techniques and tricks with focus on the natural flow of movement, authentic expression and healthy movement.", "start": "2025-08-15T10:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T12:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "0a759b58-84dc-46c3-9833-4a1c4b80b84c", "typeId": "805ca0a6-de05-4fee-a0ea-61602e8a2559", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
},{
"id": "477ebe1b-560d-4384-9162-fbfc2a2f682c", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "PFX", "name_EN": "PFX", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "S temnými přestávkami, kmenovými rytmy a plynulými zvukovými plochami vytváří PFX žánrově rozmazaný zvuk. Ovlivněn dubem, junglem a britskou basou, obratně žongluje se svým voskem, aby vytvořil nečekané cesty hlubokými, basy poháněnými a hypnotickými atmosférami.", "description_EN": "With dark breaks, tribal rhythms, and flowing soundscapes, PFX crafts a genre-blurring sound. Influenced by dub, jungle, and UK bass, he deftly juggles his wax to create unexpected journeys through deep, bass-driven, and hypnotic atmospheres.", "start": "2025-08-18T04:00:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-18T06:30:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []
