"id": "48dfe0c0-12e4-4f04-992a-2b3f27d84047", "place":{"id": "5f32ef9b-d255-4420-95be-101ba551381c", "name": "Dock", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "Sharp B2B Flake", "name_EN": "Sharp B2B Flake", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Flake a Sharp, dva rodáci z Horního Rakouska se sklonem k minimalismu, objevili svou vášeň pro hudbu již v raném věku. Spolu se skupinou stejně smýšlejících jedinců začali organizovat techno akce a koncerty v rodném městě Sharks Gaspoltshofen. Postupem času se připojili ke kolektivu Kaze Elza, se kterým chtějí obohatit rakouskou malou, ale znamenitou minimal techno scénu. Jejich zvuk, vyznačující se zálibou v jazzových tónech a nevýrazném šepotu, může být docela sofistikovaný, ale ostrost a fláky vyvažují hluboké basové linky a chytlavé bicí vzory.", "description_EN": "Flake and Sharp, two natives of Upper Austria with a penchant for minimalism, discovered their passion for music at an early age. Together with a group of like-minded individuals, they began organizing techno events and concerts in sharp’s hometown Gaspoltshofen. Over time, they joined the Kaze Elza collective, with which they aim to enrich Austria’s small but exquisite minimal techno scene. Their sound, characterized by a fondness for jazzy tones and indistinct whispers, can be quite sophisticated, but the sharpness and flakeness is balanced out by deep basslines and catchy drum patterns.", "start": "2025-08-15T00:00:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T02:00:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "5f32ef9b-d255-4420-95be-101ba551381c", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []
},{"id": "4c77e167-d51b-44eb-bf06-b205b9b8f39e", "place":{"id": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "name": "Spinning @ Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "name": "Tanec/Pohyb", "name_EN":"Dance/Movement", "color": "#E3D08C"}, "name": "Tutting", "name_EN": "Tutting", "name_Secondary": "Ambra", "description": "IG: @ambra_occhipinti, Co sebou: Energie!\r\n", "description_EN": "IG: @ambra_occhipinti, What to bring: Energy!\r\n", "start": "2025-08-16T13:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T15:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "typeId": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "tags": [{"id": "45d628ea-15e5-444b-a8a6-b624d86d002b", "name": "Středně pokročilí", "name_EN":"Intermediate"}]},{
"id": "4cd1f3c9-3e62-4a98-9ef0-23904c5711d4", "place":{"id": "5db9a114-6861-494a-9ba5-abc0f93ac6e8", "name": "Meadow", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "ae9f94a9-6dc0-479e-a445-1129a113627f", "name": "Juggling", "name_EN":"Juggling", "color": "#AEA994"}, "name": "Club contacts and sideswap basics", "name_EN": "Club contacts and sideswap basics", "name_Secondary": "Bambini", "description": "IG: @sugerrysuggerman, Co sebou: Žonglérské kluby\r\nV tomto workshopu se ponoříme do základů sidewapů a trikové tvorby zažijeme neomezené možnosti žonglování. Zkombinujeme to s některými kontaktními vrhy a vrhy tělem.", "description_EN": "IG: @sugerrysuggerman, What to bring: Juggling clubs\r\nIn this workshop we will dive into the basics of sideswaps and trick creations experiencing the unlimited possibilities of juggling. We will combine this with some contact rolls and body throws.", "start": "2025-08-17T15:00:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-17T16:30:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "5db9a114-6861-494a-9ba5-abc0f93ac6e8", "typeId": "ae9f94a9-6dc0-479e-a445-1129a113627f", "tags": [{"id": "45d628ea-15e5-444b-a8a6-b624d86d002b", "name": "Středně pokročilí", "name_EN":"Intermediate"}]
},{
"id": "4e321162-5754-4dd1-b772-21a63354a45c", "place":{"id": "0a759b58-84dc-46c3-9833-4a1c4b80b84c", "name": "Aerial Dome", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "805ca0a6-de05-4fee-a0ea-61602e8a2559", "name": "Aerial", "name_EN":"Aerial", "color": "#92CBFF"}, "name": "The Art of Innovation Through Fire & Aerial", "name_EN": "The Art of Innovation Through Fire & Aerial", "name_Secondary": "Tammy FireFly", "description": "IG: @TammyFireFly, Co sebou: Tréninkové oblečení, vzdušné popruhy, Yogamat, flow nebo požární rekvizity dle výběru\r\nToto je dynamický letecký workshop navržený tak, aby pozdvihl vaše umění prostřednictvím přesnosti, síly a inovace. ponoříte se hluboko do základů silné letecké techniky se zaměřením na čisté linie, uvědomění si těla a účinné dráhy pohybu. Z tohoto technického základu prozkoumáme, jak vybudovat expresivní a originální choreografii jak na zemi, tak ve vzduchu. Tammy také představí unikátní metody pro umělecké začleňování ohnivých nebo proudových prvků do vzdušné a pozemní práce a nabídne nástroje pro umělce, kteří chtějí rozšířit svou tvůrčí slovní zásobu. Otevřeno pro středně pokročilé – pokročilé aerialisty a hasiče. Hlavním zařízením budou popruhy, ale tuto techniku lze použít na jakékoli vzdušné zařízení.", "description_EN": "IG: @TammyFireFly, What to bring: Training Clothes, Aerial straps, Yogamat, flow or fire props of choice\r\nThis is a dynamic aerial workshop designed to elevate your artistry through precision, power, and innovation. you'll dive deep into the foundations of strong aerial technique, focusing on clean lines, body awareness, and efficient movement pathways. From this technical base, we’ll explore how to build expressive & original choreography both on the ground and in the air. Tammy will also introduce unique methods for artistically incorporating fire or flow prop elements into aerial and ground-based work, offering tools for performers looking to expand their creative vocabulary. Open to intermediate - advanced aerialist & fire artists. The Main apparatus will be straps but the technique can be applied to any aerial apparatus.", "start": "2025-08-16T12:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T13:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "0a759b58-84dc-46c3-9833-4a1c4b80b84c", "typeId": "805ca0a6-de05-4fee-a0ea-61602e8a2559", "tags": [{"id": "45d628ea-15e5-444b-a8a6-b624d86d002b", "name": "Středně pokročilí", "name_EN":"Intermediate"}]
},{
"id": "4eec1c6b-97df-4377-9cf0-c5379954beb5", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "e7fc379a-08b6-4c55-bf80-ab739a49cb3a", "name": "Všechny tyče", "name_EN":"All staffs", "color": "#7289F0"}, "name": "Z Traps & Variations", "name_EN": "Z Traps & Variations", "name_Secondary": "Aram Sempervirens", "description": "IG: @aramsempervirens, Co sebou: Dragonstaff\r\nJste připraveni ponořit se hlouběji do světa dračích zaměstnanců? V tomto workshopu prozkoumáme základy Z pastí – ty uspokojující okamžiky, kdy se personál na okamžik zachytí a přesměruje podél vašeho těla. Naučíte se vstupovat, držet a opouštět čisté Z pasti a objevovat kreativní variace pomocí práce nohou, změn roviny a různých technik úchopu. Ať už chcete vyhladit svůj tok nebo přidat dynamické pauzy do svých komb, tato relace vám poskytne nástroje, které povýší váš styl. Otevřeno všem úrovním – připravte se na pasti a hraní!", "description_EN": "IG: @aramsempervirens, What to bring: Dragonstaff\r\nReady to dive deeper into the world of dragon staff? In this workshop, we'll explore the fundamentals of Z traps—those satisfying moments when the staff momentarily catches and redirects along your body. You'll learn how to enter, hold, and exit clean Z traps, and discover creative variations using footwork, plane changes, and different grip techniques. Whether you're looking to smooth out your flow or add dynamic pauses to your combos, this session will give you tools to elevate your style. Open to all levels—come ready to trap and play!", "start": "2025-08-16T16:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T18:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "e7fc379a-08b6-4c55-bf80-ab739a49cb3a", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
},{
"id": "5005e107-c980-4d53-902d-f8a45a5ad28d", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "Julia B2B Puri", "name_EN": "Julia B2B Puri", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Julia je sama umělkyně ohně, takže přesně ví, co pohání náš proud!\r\nSvou DJskou cestu začala v loňském roce a již rozzářila pódia na Deep Camp, Fusion Festival a European Juggling Convention v Ovaru.\r\nJejí zvuk mísí melodický dubstep s psychedelickým trapem, poháněný hlubokými basovými linkami a působivými breakbeaty – zaručeně udrží vysokou energii a oheň.\r\n\r\nBlasphemix: Tomuto muži není nic svaté. Nespoutaný a radikální Blasphemix čerpá z hudby, kterou dovedně přepracoval do svého osobního kultu – rozmazává žánrové linie a vzdoruje konvencím. Společné vlákno? Vždy to „něco jisté“... a hluboký, nezaměnitelný low-end. To je to, co definuje Blasphemix: hudební rozmanitost. Jeho sety jsou divoké, žánrově ohýbající jízdy – malé horské dráhy v mnoha příchutích, které basová hudba nabízí. Prostě Baesst!", "description_EN": "Julia is a fire artist herself, so she knows exactly what fuels our flow!\r\nShe began her DJ journey last year and has already lit up stages at Deep Camp, Fusion Festival, and the European Juggling Convention in Ovar.\r\nHer sound blends melodic dubstep with psychedelic trap, driven by deep basslines and punchy breakbeats — guaranteed to keep the energy high and fire burning.\r\n\r\nBlasphemix: Nothing is sacred to this man. Unrestrained and radical, Blasphemix draws from music he’s skillfully redistilled into his own personal cult—blurring genre lines and defying convention. The common thread? Always that “certain something”… and a deep, unmistakable low-end. That’s what defines Blasphemix: musical diversity. His sets are wild, genre-bending rides—little rollercoasters through the many flavors Bass music has to offer. Just the Baesst!", "start": "2025-08-16T01:00:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T02:30:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []
},{
"id": "52313463-629d-4a53-adf8-6d52535fa512", "place":{"id": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "name": "Spinning @ Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "name": "Tanec/Pohyb", "name_EN":"Dance/Movement", "color": "#E3D08C"}, "name": "Lines in Motion: Ballet for Flow Artists", "name_EN": "Lines in Motion: Ballet for Flow Artists", "name_Secondary": "Jade Clayton", "description": "IG: @jadushka38, Co sebou: Jen pohodlné oblečení\r\nGrace se setkává s uzemněním v této otevřené baletní dílně navržené speciálně pro hybatele, tvůrce a proudové umělce. Lines in Motion přináší klasický balet do rozhovoru se současným pohybem a zve vás k prozkoumání rovnováhy, přítomnosti a kontroly prostřednictvím elegance baletu. Zaměříme se na držení těla, muzikálnost a plynulé přechody – dovednosti, které zdokonalují všechny pohybové disciplíny, od žonglování po vzdušný tanec. Po zahřátí na základě techniky prozkoumáme jednoduché fráze, které zdůrazňují prostorové povědomí, čisté linie a výrazný pohyb. Ať už jste úplný začátečník nebo zkušený hybatel, budete se cítit více propojeni se svým tělem a inspirováni tichou silou baletu. Nejsou potřeba žádné předchozí baletní zkušenosti. Vezměte si s sebou pohodlné oblečení, zvědavost a ochotu zpomalit a naladit se.", "description_EN": "IG: @jadushka38, What to bring: Just comfortable clothes\r\nGrace meets groundedness in this open-level ballet workshop designed especially for movers, makers, and flow artists. Lines in Motion brings classical ballet into conversation with contemporary movement, inviting you to explore balance, presence, and control through the elegance of ballet. We’ll focus on posture, musicality, and fluid transitions—skills that enhance all movement disciplines, from juggling to aerial dance. After a technique-informed warm-up, we’ll explore simple phrases that emphasize spatial awareness, clean lines, and expressive motion. Whether you’re a total beginner or an experienced mover, you’ll leave feeling more connected to your body and inspired by ballet’s quiet power. No previous ballet experience needed. Just bring comfortable clothes, curiosity, and a willingness to slow down and tune in.", "start": "2025-08-16T10:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T12:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "typeId": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
},{
"id": "52eadf58-4cb1-467e-be27-870e0aef1a60", "place":{"id": "11eec21d-ca1d-440c-9222-993490773ee7", "name": "Forest", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "ae6c4550-5f1e-4ffb-8b81-f88e4668f40a", "name": "Yoga", "name_EN":"Yoga", "color": "#FFB451"}, "name": "Tai Ji moving meditation", "name_EN": "Tai Ji moving meditation", "name_Secondary": "Van-Kim Tran - Cie Monad", "description": "IG: @CieMonad, Co sebou: sebe\r\nPohybová meditace Tai Ji Tao je způsob, jak sjednotit tělo a mysl. Prostřednictvím opakování jednoduchých forem si procvičíme zvyšování tělesného a pohybového povědomí. Je to skvělá podpora pro jakýkoli cirkusový trénink. Mezi další praktikující tohoto stylu, které možná znáte, patří Ronan Mc Loughlin a Meast/Romain Marguaritte", "description_EN": "IG: @CieMonad, What to bring: yourself\r\nTai Ji Tao moving meditation is a way to unify the body and the mind. Through the repetition of simple forms, we will practice increasing body and movement awareness. It is a great support for any circus training. Other practitionners of this style that you may know includes Ronan Mc Loughlin and Meast/Romain Marguaritte", "start": "2025-08-15T09:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T10:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "11eec21d-ca1d-440c-9222-993490773ee7", "typeId": "ae6c4550-5f1e-4ffb-8b81-f88e4668f40a", "tags": [{"id": "35f1e8bc-7735-43fb-8caa-5d87e940a8b3", "name": "Masterclass", "name_EN":"Masterclass"}]
},{
"id": "55d8f1a5-da1e-4ac2-9715-0f79a8d52d84", "place":{"id": "7f56de3c-ae91-4bc3-8d2c-a9b4fd401b18", "name": "Tchaiovna", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "fecad87f-08cd-48ef-952c-b72fdc3fe775", "name": "Live music", "name_EN":"Live music", "color": "#43e90c"}, "name": "Yamaha Oriental", "name_EN": "Yamaha Oriental", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "YAMAHA ORIENTAL = 100% HIT\r\n\r\nGRUPA MUZIKA BALKAN PRAG\r\n\r\n100% současná balkánská cikánská hudba. Čoček, Kuček, Tallava a Manele. Ferus Mustafov, Boril Iliev, Amza Tairov, Ionut Cercel, Sali Okka a další. Psychedelický taneční zážitek na celý život.\r\n", "description_EN": "YAMAHA ORIENTAL = 100% HIT\r\n\r\nGRUPA MUZIKA BALKAN PRAG\r\n\r\n100% Contemporary balkan gipsy music. Čoček, Kuček, Tallava and Manele. Ferus Mustafov, Boril Iliev, Amza Tairov, Ionut Cercel, Sali Okka, and more. A psychedelic-dance experience of your lifetime.\r\n", "start": "2025-08-16T00:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T01:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "7f56de3c-ae91-4bc3-8d2c-a9b4fd401b18", "typeId": "fecad87f-08cd-48ef-952c-b72fdc3fe775", "tags": []
},{
"id": "571a1201-95e7-4ab7-a0c6-b2927e0eecab", "place":{"id": "5f32ef9b-d255-4420-95be-101ba551381c", "name": "Dock", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "Grove", "name_EN": "Grove", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Grove je one-man projekt z Prahy, který skládá hudbu od roku 1996. Jako jeden z mála se u nás věnuje klasickému breakovému zvuku s lehkým progresivním a funky nádechem a techhouse. V poslední době také vydává ambientní nahrávky. Jeho největší úspěchy byly z pozitivních recenzí od nejuznávanějších jmen, jako je Adam Freeland, Elite Force, Future Funk Squad a další.\r\n", "description_EN": "Grove is a one-man project from Prague, which has been composing music since 1996. It is one of the few in our country dedicated to the classic break sound with a slight progressive and funky touch and techhouse. Recently he has also been releasing ambient recordings. His biggest successes have been from positive reviews from the most authoritative names such as Adam Freeland, Elite Force, Future Funk Squad and others.\r\n", "start": "2025-08-17T02:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-17T04:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "5f32ef9b-d255-4420-95be-101ba551381c", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []
},{
