"id": "65060f8e-2bc6-4399-b44d-80a570d7dbee", "place":{"id": "f049336d-e8e1-4ef2-bd15-94105f467fce", "name": "Beach", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "e7fc379a-08b6-4c55-bf80-ab739a49cb3a", "name": "Všechny tyče", "name_EN":"All staffs", "color": "#7289F0"}, "name": "Staff: how to develop your own, unique relationship with the prop", "name_EN": "Staff: how to develop your own, unique relationship with the prop", "name_Secondary": "Kerosene", "description": "IG: @_kero_sene_\nCo si s sebou přinést: Nože\n\nWorkshop bude zkoumat točení holí jednou rukou. To znamená vyvinout tok otáčením hole pouze jednou rukou, levou nebo pravou, bez jejího předávání do druhé.\nNěkteré pohyby pak otevřou možnost provedení současně oběma rukama a budou integrovány do dvojitého toku holí.\n\nNěkteré pohyby pak otevřou možnost provedení současně oběma rukama a budou integrovány do dvojitého toku holí.", "description_EN": "IG: @_kero_sene_\nWhat to bring: Staff\n\n\nThe workshop will be an exploration of single-hand staff spinning. This means to develop a flow by spinning a staff with only one hand, the left or the right, without passing it to the other.\nSome moves will then open the possibility to be performed simultaneously with both hands, being integrated in a double staff flow.\n\nSome moves will then open the possibility to be performed simultaneously with both hands, being integrated in a double staff flow.\n", "start": "2025-08-14T15:00:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-14T16:30:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "f049336d-e8e1-4ef2-bd15-94105f467fce", "typeId": "e7fc379a-08b6-4c55-bf80-ab739a49cb3a", "tags": [{"id": "ba7623dc-5239-49d6-9b7c-5a56d8bf4b02", "name": "Začátečníci", "name_EN":"Beginner"}]
},{
"id": "65266a28-5287-4212-850e-07e6a9ed8b74", "place":{"id": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "name": "Spinning @ Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "ae6c4550-5f1e-4ffb-8b81-f88e4668f40a", "name": "Yoga", "name_EN":"Yoga", "color": "#FFB451"}, "name": "Nourishing thai massage", "name_EN": "Nourishing thai massage", "name_Secondary": "Dunja", "description": "IG: @zabunja, Co sebou: Yogamat\r\nPotřebný workshop na závěr festivalu pro rozpuštění našich tvrdě trénovaných svalů. Účastníci poskytují a dostávají 40minutovou masáž celého těla v oblečení thajské masáže.", "description_EN": "IG: @zabunja, What to bring: Yogamat\r\nA much needed workshop at the end of the festival for melting our hard trained muscles. Participants give and receive a full body massage of 40min fully clothed through the dance of thai massage.", "start": "2025-08-17T16:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-17T18:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "typeId": "ae6c4550-5f1e-4ffb-8b81-f88e4668f40a", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
},{
"id": "6692f983-8dbc-4438-b669-61c82f2eccdc", "place":{"id": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "name": "Spinning @ Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "2a8fa9ce-b0d9-4bea-afb1-e07efd0211de", "name": "Lecture/Performance presence", "name_EN":"Lecture/Performance presence", "color": ""}, "name": "Flow Workshop Design", "name_EN": "Flow Workshop Design", "name_Secondary": "Romany Firestarter", "description": "IG: @Sis_set_u, Co sebou: Notebook a pero\r\nChcete jednoho dne sami učit flow workshop, ale nemáte ponětí, kde začít nebo jak správně vyjádřit své poselství? Učíte již, ale chtěli byste zlepšit své dovednosti v oblasti flow learning? Už nehledejte! Na tomto workshopu se naučíte, jak navrhnout flow workshop od nápadu až po samotnou výuku. Dozvíte se, kde začít, jak se připravit, jak rozlišovat mezi úrovněmi a styly učení a jak skončit, pomocí užitečných tipů a triků získaných zkušenostmi od vyškoleného učitele umění. V tomto workshopu je také prostor pro osobní zkušenosti, takže všichni můžeme vyrůst jako učitelé toku! Toto je spíše teoretický workshop, takže možná budete chtít přinést něco na poznámky.", "description_EN": "IG: @Sis_set_u, What to bring: Notebook and Pen\r\nDo you want to teach a flow workshop yourself one day but have no clue where to start or how to voice your message correctly? Do you already teach but would like to improve your flow teaching skills? Look no further! In this workshop you'll learn in how to design a flow workshop from idea to the actual teaching itself. You'll learn where to start, how to prepare, how to differentiate between levels and learning styles, and how to close, with useful tips and tricks gained by experience along the way from a trained arts teacher. In this workshop there's also room for personal experiences so we might all grow as flow teachers! This is a more theoretical workshop, so you might want to bring something for notes.", "start": "2025-08-15T10:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T12:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "typeId": "2a8fa9ce-b0d9-4bea-afb1-e07efd0211de", "tags": []
},{
"id": "673b0e12-8a89-4726-ae45-84dfaf210877", "place":{"id": "f15dabd2-1383-4338-8a1f-06686ae32ad9", "name": "Psylo Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "0b6cd902-494b-454b-a291-aa0fb3a0f7d5", "name": "Rope dart", "name_EN":"Rope dart", "color": "#F7DF69"}, "name": "All the Neck Wraps", "name_EN": "All the Neck Wraps", "name_Secondary": "Radi Flows", "description": "IG: @radi_flows, Co sebou: Šipka na laně\r\nTento workshop se zaměří na různé druhy zábalů krku, průběžné zábaly krku, obraty a záběry ze zábalu.\r\n\r\nNěkteré pohyby pak otevřou možnost provádět současně oběma rukama, protože jsou integrovány do dvojitého toku hole.", "description_EN": "IG: @radi_flows, What to bring: Rope dart\r\nThis workshop will focuses on a variety of different neck wraps, continous neck wraps, turns and shots from neckwrap.\r\n\r\nSome moves will then open the possibility to be performed simultaneously with both hands, being integrated in a double staff flow.", "start": "2025-08-17T13:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-17T15:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "f15dabd2-1383-4338-8a1f-06686ae32ad9", "typeId": "0b6cd902-494b-454b-a291-aa0fb3a0f7d5", "tags": [{"id": "ba7623dc-5239-49d6-9b7c-5a56d8bf4b02", "name": "Začátečníci", "name_EN":"Beginner"}]
