"id": "689bdd5b-9662-4825-98b6-5eb37e0b9ed2", "place":{"id": "5f32ef9b-d255-4420-95be-101ba551381c", "name": "Dock", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "Liquid Wallah", "name_EN": "Liquid Wallah", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Se dvěma Roztočskými vystoupeními a řadou ohnivých setů na konvencích se tento DJ poslední rok ponořil hluboko do back-to-back, vypiloval své řemeslo a vybudoval eklektický, groovově vydatný zvuk. Loni zabalili bunkr v Roztoči, takže si všichni odskočili a dali si basu. Ať už se těla pohybují na tanečním parketu nebo se stávají divnými v prostoru ohně, jsou zpět a připraveni znovu doručit.", "description_EN": "With two Roztoč appearances and a string of fiery sets at conventions under their belt, this DJ has spent the last year diving deep into back-to-backs, sharpening their craft, and building an eclectic, groove-hearty sound. Last year, they packed out the bunker at Roztoč, making everyone bounce and get their fix of bass. Whether it’s making bodies move in the dance floor or getting weird in the fire space, they’re back and ready to deliver once again.", "start": "2025-08-17T04:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-17T06:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "5f32ef9b-d255-4420-95be-101ba551381c", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []
},{
"id": "69d27b1f-52ec-41f4-9a25-2b0560144e99", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "1617d663-ed2a-4d11-80e3-a6159dda7ada", "name": "Fans", "name_EN":"Fans", "color": "#ff5252"}, "name": "Crossers", "name_EN": "Crossers", "name_Secondary": "Iveta", "description": "IG: @navri.flow, Co sebou: Ventilátory (ideálně ruský grip, grip Doodle je také v pořádku)\r\nPojďme se naučit základní crosser a pár jeho variací.", "description_EN": "IG: @navri.flow, What to bring: Fans (ideally Russian grip, Doodle grip is also fine)\r\nLet's learn the basic crosser and a few of its variations.", "start": "2025-08-14T13:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-14T15:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "1617d663-ed2a-4d11-80e3-a6159dda7ada", "tags": [{"id": "45d628ea-15e5-444b-a8a6-b624d86d002b", "name": "Středně pokročilí", "name_EN":"Intermediate"}]
},{
"id": "6e86e736-1a1a-46bc-a418-f46423d843ac", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "cad9ef0a-f382-406d-85fc-e8a7686b7a4f", "name": "Poi", "name_EN":"Poi", "color": "#b4d576"}, "name": "Introduction to Partner Poi", "name_EN": "Introduction to Partner Poi", "name_Secondary": "Gaia & Elliot", "description": "IG: @GaiaWard a @Elliotcircusarts\n\nCo si s sebou vzít: Vezměte si s sebou poi! Ideálně měkké poi nebo ponožkové poi.\n\nVymysleli jsme sekvenci, kterou budeme učit a která prochází všemi kombinacemi pozic rukou a těla a směrů otáčení v rámci základního vzoru proplétání. S použitím jednoho poi pro každou postavu vše rozebereme zpět k základnímu pochopení těchto drah proplétání ve vašem těle a připravíme vás na všechny možnosti při přidávání druhého poi a pohybu.", "description_EN": "IG: @GaiaWard & @Elliotcircusarts\n\nWhat to bring: Bring your poi! Ideally soft poi or sock poi\n\nWe have devised a sequence we will teach which moves through all combinations of of hand and body positions and spinning directions within a basic weave pattern. Using one poi each, we will strip everything back to a foundational understanding of these weave pathways in your body preparing you for all of the possibilities when adding the second poi and movement.", "start": "2025-08-14T15:00:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-14T16:30:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "cad9ef0a-f382-406d-85fc-e8a7686b7a4f", "tags": []
},{
"id": "709a120c-2797-4106-bf1f-ff4918da5daa", "place":{"id": "1c157563-cf57-4020-b024-7883d2897d94", "name": "Sunset Stage", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "fecad87f-08cd-48ef-952c-b72fdc3fe775", "name": "Live music", "name_EN":"Live music", "color": "#43e90c"}, "name": "Rumbalgia", "name_EN": "Rumbalgia", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Hudba Rumbalgia zrozená v roce 2016 přináší rychlý styl s vlivy romské kultury, kubánské hudby, nádechem swingu a špetkou salsy. Jsme mezinárodní kapela se členy z různých koutů světa a smíchali jsme naše zázemí a vize, abychom přišli s jedinečným a osobním stylem. Jsme potěšeni, že můžeme do Prahy přivézt esenci španělských pouličních večírků a nejvřelejší rumba vibrace.", "description_EN": "Born in 2016, Rumbalgia’s music brings an uptempo style with influences from Gypsy culture, Cuban music, a touch of swing and a pinch of salsa. We are an international band with members from different corners of the world and we mixed our backgrounds and visions in order to come up with a unique and personal style. We are pleased to bring to Prague the essence of the Spanish street parties and the warmest rumba vibes.", "start": "2025-08-17T19:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-17T20:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "1c157563-cf57-4020-b024-7883d2897d94", "typeId": "fecad87f-08cd-48ef-952c-b72fdc3fe775", "tags": []
},{
"id": "711a254f-9094-4386-9eb9-5801c244a47c", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "Leisetreter", "name_EN": "Leisetreter", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Skladatel, hudební producent a hasičský umělec z Berlína, Německo. Od roku 2011 přináší skákavé beaty, vzrušující melodie, oduševnělé texty a dramatické struktury písní do ohňových prostorů.\r\n", "description_EN": "Songwriter, music producer & fire artist from Berlin, Germany. Bringing bouncy beats, thrilling melodies, soulful lyrics and dramatic song structures to firespaces since 2011.\r\n", "start": "2025-08-15T23:30:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T01:00:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []
},{
"id": "7244e67e-247c-4e83-8440-a69944280174", "place":{"id": "5db9a114-6861-494a-9ba5-abc0f93ac6e8", "name": "Meadow", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "cad9ef0a-f382-406d-85fc-e8a7686b7a4f", "name": "Poi", "name_EN":"Poi", "color": "#b4d576"}, "name": "1 poi 1 hand", "name_EN": "1 poi 1 hand", "name_Secondary": "Anton Nosovitsky", "description": "IG: @psychuil, Co sebou: 1 poi\r\nNaučme se co nejvíce o hraní s jedním poi. 1 člověk zvolil nejlepší workshop Roztoče 2024.", "description_EN": "IG: @psychuil, What to bring: 1 poi\r\nLet's learn as much as we can about playing with a single poi. Voted best workshop of Roztoc 2024 by 1 person.", "start": "2025-08-15T10:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T12:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "5db9a114-6861-494a-9ba5-abc0f93ac6e8", "typeId": "cad9ef0a-f382-406d-85fc-e8a7686b7a4f", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
},{
"id": "72a55a16-5b7d-47b3-b0d4-7b095703fcba", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "e7fc379a-08b6-4c55-bf80-ab739a49cb3a", "name": "Všechny tyče", "name_EN":"All staffs", "color": "#7289F0"}, "name": "Dancing with long-string Leviwand", "name_EN": "Dancing with long-string Leviwand", "name_Secondary": "Alex Firedancer", "description": "IG: @alex_firedancer_, Co sebou: Ploché boty\r\nJako instruktor latinského tance s více než 23letými tanečními zkušenostmi vám ukážu, jak bez námahy rozhýbat své tělo kvalitněji a méně energie a přitom proudit s leviwand. Tento workshop není zaměřen na vylepšení vaší Levi-Skill, ale spíše na to, abyste si vyzkoušeli, jak můžete skutečně používat základní taneční techniku a elegantně se pohybovat a přitom být stále ve spojení se svým Levi. Hlavním cílem tohoto workshopu je rozšířit své obzory jako FlowArtist tím, že vám nabídneme možnost tančit s Levi.", "description_EN": "IG: @alex_firedancer_, What to bring: Flat shoes\r\nAs a Latin dance Instructor with over 23 years of dancing experience I will show you how to effortlessly move your body with more quality and less energy while flowing with your Leviwand. This Workshop is not focued on upleveling your Levi-Skill, but more on experiencing how you can actually use basic dance technique and elegantly move while still being connected to your Levi. The main goal of this workshop is to expand your horizon as a FlowArtist by introducing you the opportunity of dancing with the Levi.", "start": "2025-08-15T12:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T13:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "e7fc379a-08b6-4c55-bf80-ab739a49cb3a", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
},{
"id": "74d238e2-c1ae-4c47-a7b1-15dcc9bf32c4", "place":{"id": "5f32ef9b-d255-4420-95be-101ba551381c", "name": "Dock", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "Cyrill", "name_EN": "Cyrill", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Ahoj, já jsem Cyrill, DJ ze Švýcarska, který rád hraje různé druhy hudebních žánrů. Během roku často hraji na party můj oblíbený skákací styl Zenon/Darkprog nebo Psyprog. Také hraji na všech národních akcích Flowarts ve Švýcarsku a stále více na mezinárodních akcích Psydub/Psychill/Downtempo. Těšíme se, že si opět zahrajeme v mocném Roztoči!", "description_EN": "Hey I‘m Cyrill, a DJ from Switzerland enjoying to play many different kinds of music genres. During the year I often play at parties my my favorite bouncy style of Zenon/Darkprog or Psyprog. Also I play at all the national Flowarts events in Switzerland trippy and flowy Psydub/Psychill/Downtempo as well more and more at international events. Looking forward to play again at the mighty Roztoč!", "start": "2025-08-18T02:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-18T04:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "5f32ef9b-d255-4420-95be-101ba551381c", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []
},{
"id": "75b6015a-b57b-47a1-a63e-27c1f03b7f34", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "e7fc379a-08b6-4c55-bf80-ab739a49cb3a", "name": "Všechny tyče", "name_EN":"All staffs", "color": "#7289F0"}, "name": "Partner Dragonstaff", "name_EN": "Partner Dragonstaff", "name_Secondary": "Jed Fowler\r\n", "description": "IG: @mr_jedly, Co sebou: Dračí personál\r\nNaučte se, jak se stát partnerem Dragonstaff! Tento workshop se točí kolem chi rollů, mostů, různých průchodů a jejich kombinování do různých způsobů interakce se svým partnerem a zároveň sdílení stejného personálu! T-Party na oslavu!", "description_EN": "IG: @mr_jedly, What to bring: Dragon staff\r\nLearn how to partner dragonstaff! This workshop revolves around chi rolls, bridges, various passes, and combining them into various ways to interact with your partner while sharing the same staff! T-Party to celebrate!", "start": "2025-08-17T12:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-17T13:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "e7fc379a-08b6-4c55-bf80-ab739a49cb3a", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
},{
"id": "7638485e-f78d-42e1-b9e7-2dc9361de8b2", "place":{"id": "0a759b58-84dc-46c3-9833-4a1c4b80b84c", "name": "Aerial Dome", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "805ca0a6-de05-4fee-a0ea-61602e8a2559", "name": "Aerial", "name_EN":"Aerial", "color": "#92CBFF"}, "name": "Dynamic Aerial Straps", "name_EN": "Dynamic Aerial Straps", "name_Secondary": "Tammy FireFly", "description": "IG: @TammyFireFly, Co sebou: popruhy, tréninkové oblečení a podložka na jógu\r\nPosuňte svou techniku popruhů na další úroveň s velkými lety, rychlými rotacemi, dynamickými cestami s jednoručkami a plynulými přechody. Prozkoumáme hybnost, ovládání a inovace ve vzduchu, které jsou navrženy pro zkušené aerialisty připravené prozkoumat kreativitu, půvab a sílu na anténních popruhech.", "description_EN": "IG: @TammyFireFly, What to bring: straps, training clothes and yoga mat\r\nTake your straps technique to the next level with big flights, fast spins, dynamic pathways one-arm sequencing, & smooth transitioning. We will explore momentum, control, and innovation in the air, designed for experienced aerialists ready to explore creativity, grace & strength on aerial straps.", "start": "2025-08-15T13:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T15:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "0a759b58-84dc-46c3-9833-4a1c4b80b84c", "typeId": "805ca0a6-de05-4fee-a0ea-61602e8a2559", "tags": [{"id": "45d628ea-15e5-444b-a8a6-b624d86d002b", "name": "Středně pokročilí", "name_EN":"Intermediate"}]
},{
"id": "7685d4d9-55c5-48db-96d9-f37c73f18b6f", "place":{"id": "0a759b58-84dc-46c3-9833-4a1c4b80b84c", "name": "Aerial Dome", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "cd55fbd9-0c00-43fb-8a65-90097bc8d043", "name": "Acro", "name_EN":"Acro", "color": "#82735C"}, "name": "Handstand & Acrobatics with Props", "name_EN": "Handstand & Acrobatics with Props", "name_Secondary": "Benji", "description": "IG: , Co sebou: Rekvizity dle výběru\r\n„Vyvažování rukou a akrobacie s rekvizitami“\r\nTento workshop zkoumá spojení handbalancování a akrobatické techniky s různými rekvizitami. Zaměříme se na to, jak začlenit rovnováhu, sílu a plynulost do vaší rekvizitní praxe – ať už pracujete se štábem, klubem, obručí nebo něčím zcela jedinečným. Naučíte se základní cvičení a kreativní přístupy, jak bezpečně rozvíjet svou kontrolu a přítomnost při vyvažování nebo přechodu kolem zvoleného objektu. Otevřeno pro všechny úrovně, toto je pozvánka, abyste zpochybnili gravitaci a rozšířili svou fyzickou slovní zásobu.", "description_EN": "What to bring: Props of choice\r\n\"Handbalancing & Acrobatics with Props\"\r\nThis workshop explores the fusion of handbalancing and acrobatic technique with various props. We'll focus on how to integrate balance, strength, and fluidity into your prop practice—whether you're working with a staff, club, hoop, or something entirely unique. You’ll learn foundational drills and creative approaches to safely develop your control and presence while balancing or transitioning around your chosen object. Open to all levels, this is an invitation to challenge gravity and expand your physical vocabulary.", "start": "2025-08-16T10:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T12:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "0a759b58-84dc-46c3-9833-4a1c4b80b84c", "typeId": "cd55fbd9-0c00-43fb-8a65-90097bc8d043", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
