"id": "769b1cad-60ac-4367-bcfe-93eb81e495eb", "place":{"id": "0a759b58-84dc-46c3-9833-4a1c4b80b84c", "name": "Aerial Dome", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "ae6c4550-5f1e-4ffb-8b81-f88e4668f40a", "name": "Yoga", "name_EN":"Yoga", "color": "#FFB451"}, "name": "Safe Backbends", "name_EN": "Safe Backbends", "name_Secondary": "Aja Horackova", "description": "IG: @aja.tales, Co sebou: Podložka na jógu\r\nBezpečné záklony 🌈 💫 Všímavé cvičení jógy zaměřené na bezpečné záklony. V této lekci prozkoumáme principy vyrovnání páteře, správné zapojení a postupný postup, abychom zajistili vaši bezpečnou praxi. 💫 Prostřednictvím dostupných variací se naučíte, jak otevřít své srdce, protáhnout záda a budovat sílu a zároveň chránit svou páteř. Ať už jste v backbend nováčci nebo chcete vylepšit svou praxi.", "description_EN": "Location Changed to psybunker because of rain\n\nIG: @aja.tales, What to bring: Yoga mat\nSafe backbends 🌈 💫 Mindful yoga session focused on safe backbending. In this class, we’ll explore the principles of spinal alignment, proper engagement, and gradual progression to ensure your safe practice. 💫 Through accessible variations, you’ll learn how to open your heart, stretch your back, and build strength while protecting your spine. Whether you’re new to backbends or looking to refine your practice.", "start": "2025-08-16T16:30:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T18:00:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "0a759b58-84dc-46c3-9833-4a1c4b80b84c", "typeId": "ae6c4550-5f1e-4ffb-8b81-f88e4668f40a", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
},{
"id": "77a3425f-df53-4eb4-a4cd-d4b50e80b0ba", "place":{"id": "5db9a114-6861-494a-9ba5-abc0f93ac6e8", "name": "Meadow", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "cad9ef0a-f382-406d-85fc-e8a7686b7a4f", "name": "Poi", "name_EN":"Poi", "color": "#b4d576"}, "name": "Advanced Poi Isolations", "name_EN": "Advanced Poi Isolations", "name_Secondary": "Alvin", "description": "IG: , Co sebou: 2 Poi\r\nPokročilé izolace Poi (pravidelná izolace POi je předpokladem pro užitek z workshopu). Začneme prozkoumávat různá načasování a pozice s jedním izolovaným bodem poi a jedním statickým bodem s rotujícím bodem. Poté objevíme místa kolem našeho těla, kde můžeme body izolovat a integrovat je do pohybu těla, abychom vytvořili úžasnou iluzi, kdy to vypadá, jako by byly body na okamžik slepené dohromady.", "description_EN": "IG: , What to bring: 2 Poi\r\nAdvanced Poi isolations (regular poi isolation is a prerequisite to benefit from the workshop). We start exploring different timings and positions with one isolated poi and one static spinning poi. After that we discover places around our body, where we can isolate the poi and integrate it into body movement to create that amazing illusion where it looks like the poi are glued together for a moment.", "start": "2025-08-15T16:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T18:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "5db9a114-6861-494a-9ba5-abc0f93ac6e8", "typeId": "cad9ef0a-f382-406d-85fc-e8a7686b7a4f", "tags": [{"id": "2866d947-b716-43bb-b71a-1d4d9c5f8800", "name": "Středně až pokročilí", "name_EN":"Intermediate/Advanced"}]
},{
"id": "7892ff8e-dc91-4e85-b12d-5438c0f7858f", "place":{"id": "7f56de3c-ae91-4bc3-8d2c-a9b4fd401b18", "name": "Tchaiovna", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "fecad87f-08cd-48ef-952c-b72fdc3fe775", "name": "Live music", "name_EN":"Live music", "color": "#43e90c"}, "name": "Cuervo Cuervo", "name_EN": "Cuervo Cuervo", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Cuervo Cuervo je setkáním myslí argentinského hudebníka a hráče na charango Agustina Ganema a amerického producenta a multiinstrumentalisty Benjamina Hilla. Po náhodném setkání v ulicích Bacalaru (Mexiko) v roce 2018 spojili své síly, aby vytvořili jedinečnou fúzi psychedelické elektronické hudby spojené s latinskoamerickým folkem a živou improvizací. K dnešnímu dni Cuervo Cuervo odehrál více než 100 vystoupení na místech a festivalech po celém Mexiku, Argentině, Guatemale, Evropě a Spojených státech. Jsou známí svými elektrizujícími živými vystoupeními s virtuózní ukázkou hudebního umění, vkusnou elektronikou, živými smyčkami a schopností improvizace a spolupráce.\r\n", "description_EN": "Cuervo Cuervo is the meeting of the minds of Argentinian musician and charango player Agustin Ganem and American producer and multi instrumentalist Benjamin Hill. After a chance meeting on the streets of Bacalar (Mexico) in 2018, they joined forces to create a unique fusion of psychedelic electronic music fused with Latin American folk and live improvisation. To date, Cuervo Cuervo has played over 100 shows at venues and festivals across Mexico, Argentina, Guatemala, Europe and the United States. They are known for their electrifying live performances featuring virtuosic displays of musicianship, tasteful electronics, live looping, and a capacity for improvisation and collaboration.\r\n", "start": "2025-08-17T17:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-17T18:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "7f56de3c-ae91-4bc3-8d2c-a9b4fd401b18", "typeId": "fecad87f-08cd-48ef-952c-b72fdc3fe775", "tags": []
},{
"id": "7976c2bf-9fa9-41ec-998b-e4f65e22ed7f", "place":{"id": "5db9a114-6861-494a-9ba5-abc0f93ac6e8", "name": "Meadow", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "cad9ef0a-f382-406d-85fc-e8a7686b7a4f", "name": "Poi", "name_EN":"Poi", "color": "#b4d576"}, "name": "Bodytracing with Poi", "name_EN": "Bodytracing with Poi", "name_Secondary": "Benni", "description": "IG: @benediktfiedler_, Co sebou: Poi\r\nMůžete se naučit různé bodytracingové vzory a pozice, které lze použít k nalezení vlastních variací. Tento workshop je vhodný pro začátečníky, ale lze jej použít i pro středně pokročilé úrovně.", "description_EN": "IG: @benediktfiedler_, What to bring: Poi\r\nYou can learn different bodytracing patterns and positions that can be used to find your own variations. This workshop is beginner friendly but can be used for more intermediate levels as well.", "start": "2025-08-15T13:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T15:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "5db9a114-6861-494a-9ba5-abc0f93ac6e8", "typeId": "cad9ef0a-f382-406d-85fc-e8a7686b7a4f", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
