"id": "810ef6b7-7d1f-40a0-aad9-e4bec4bc85ed", "place":{"id": "f15dabd2-1383-4338-8a1f-06686ae32ad9", "name": "Psylo Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "edf75421-9936-4d9b-83ca-e86654d46a9c", "name": "Niche toys", "name_EN":"Niche toys", "color": ""}, "name": "Buugeng Bliss", "name_EN": "Buugeng Bliss", "name_Secondary": "tina & Viny", "description": "V tomto workshopu prozkoumáme různé techniky a tvary, které tomuto rekvizitám dodají větší plynulost. Také si představíme pár partnerských pohybů, které se k sobě skvěle hodí. Naším cílem je otevřít vaši vlastní kreativitu a povzbudit vás k prozkoumání buugengu vaším vlastním jedinečným způsobem. Bude poskytnuto několik dalších buugengů a vítány jsou všechny úrovně dovedností!", "description_EN": "IG: @tinozZza & @flow_Xplorer\nWhat to bring: Buugeng\n\nIn this workshop, we will explore various techniques and shapes to bring more flow to this prop. We will also introduce some partner moves that work really well together. Our goal is to open up your own creativity and encourage you to explore buugeng in your own unique way. A few extra buugeng will be provided and all skill levels are welcome!\n", "start": "2025-08-16T12:00:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T13:30:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "f15dabd2-1383-4338-8a1f-06686ae32ad9", "typeId": "edf75421-9936-4d9b-83ca-e86654d46a9c", "tags": []
},{
"id": "81425ff0-07ca-43d0-94a0-407855cf356b", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "Romario", "name_EN": "Romario", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Romario a jeho výzkumný a produkční styl je ovlivněn jeho láskou k tradiční hudbě z celého světa a zdokonalil jedinečnou směs africké, brazilské, kolumbijské a východní hudby smíchanou se současnými tanečními rytmy jako dubstep, dub, afro beaty. Romario se v současnosti věnuje World Wide hudbě.", "description_EN": "Romario and his research and production style is influenced by his love of traditional music from all over the world and he has perfected a unique blend of African, Brazilian, Colombian and East music, mixed up with contemporary dancefloor rhythms such as dubstep,dub, afro beats. Romario is currently dedicated to World Wide music.", "start": "2025-08-17T01:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-17T02:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []
},{"id": "836105d7-342f-432f-82a8-1c86fd93979e", "place":{"id": "5db9a114-6861-494a-9ba5-abc0f93ac6e8", "name": "Meadow", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "cad9ef0a-f382-406d-85fc-e8a7686b7a4f", "name": "Poi", "name_EN":"Poi", "color": "#b4d576"}, "name": "Poi Spinning Beginner", "name_EN": "Poi Spinning Beginner", "name_Secondary": "Ondrej Penc", "description": "...", "description_EN": "IG: penc.ondrej\n\nBeginner Poi Moves", "start": "2025-08-15T09:00:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T10:30:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "5db9a114-6861-494a-9ba5-abc0f93ac6e8", "typeId": "cad9ef0a-f382-406d-85fc-e8a7686b7a4f", "tags": [{"id": "ba7623dc-5239-49d6-9b7c-5a56d8bf4b02", "name": "Začátečníci", "name_EN":"Beginner"}]},{
"id": "846b1b81-1f85-4bca-bd5f-40de10e5b2f4", "place":{"id": "f15dabd2-1383-4338-8a1f-06686ae32ad9", "name": "Psylo Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "1617d663-ed2a-4d11-80e3-a6159dda7ada", "name": "Fans", "name_EN":"Fans", "color": "#ff5252"}, "name": "Techy Combos", "name_EN": "Techy Combos", "name_Secondary": "Viny", "description": "IG: @flow_xplorer, Co sebou: fanoušků\r\nVítejte v technickém světě mých fanoušků! V tomto workshopu pro středně pokročilé vás naučím některá z mých oblíbených komb fanoušků! Pomocí zajímavých a náročných konceptů, jako je reverzní uchopení nebo 3D, otevřeme technické okno, abychom vyrovnali proud vašich fanoušků! Jste připraveni rozpustit své mozky?", "description_EN": "IG: @flow_xplorer, What to bring: fans\r\nWelcome to my fans tech world! In this intermediate-advanced workshop I will teach you some of my favorite fan combos! Using interesting and challenging concepts, like the reverse grip or 3D, we will open a techy window to level up your fans flow! Are you ready to melt your brains?", "start": "2025-08-15T12:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T13:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "f15dabd2-1383-4338-8a1f-06686ae32ad9", "typeId": "1617d663-ed2a-4d11-80e3-a6159dda7ada", "tags": [{"id": "45d628ea-15e5-444b-a8a6-b624d86d002b", "name": "Středně pokročilí", "name_EN":"Intermediate"}]
},{
"id": "857a371e-ca3d-453f-8ae4-55a87f133278", "place":{"id": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "name": "Spinning @ Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "name": "Tanec/Pohyb", "name_EN":"Dance/Movement", "color": "#E3D08C"}, "name": "Creativity in movement", "name_EN": "Creativity in movement", "name_Secondary": "Tereza Oršulíková", "description": "IG: @terraaqabal, Co sebou: Sebe\r\nKombinace řízené praxe a experimentování s volným průtokem. Budeme zkoumat funkčnost těla a jeho přirozenou dynamiku. Workshop je prostorem pro kreativitu v autentickém pohybu, získávání nové inspirace z experimentování a objevování jedinečné stopy našeho tance. Zaměříme se také na psychosomatické účinky tance a najdeme užitečné techniky, které lze aplikovat v každodenním životě pro celkovou pohodu.", "description_EN": "IG: @terraaqabal, What to bring: Yourself\r\nCombination of guided practice and free flow experimentation. We will research functionality of the body and its natural dynamics. The workshop is a space for creativity in authentic movement, gaining new inspiration from experimenting and discovering unique footprint of our dance. We will focus also on psychosomatic effects of dance and find useful techniques that can be applied in daily life for overall wellbeing.", "start": "2025-08-16T12:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T13:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "typeId": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
},{
"id": "86db3734-e9b5-4b88-aaa3-af8a1db873cf", "place":{"id": "1c157563-cf57-4020-b024-7883d2897d94", "name": "Sunset Stage", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "fecad87f-08cd-48ef-952c-b72fdc3fe775", "name": "Live music", "name_EN":"Live music", "color": "#43e90c"}, "name": "Mostnost", "name_EN": "Mostnost", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "MostNost vzešel z pražské jamovací scény spojující místní a expaty. Jejich hudba leží mezi gnres a těžce si vypůjčuje z fusion jazzu s doteky psychhadelického rocku a lo-fi. Cílem skladeb je vzít posluchače na cestu napříč žánry, rytmy a světy a nechat hudbu, aby vás pohnula zevnitř.", "description_EN": "MostNost emerged from Pragues jamming scene combining locals and expats. Their music lies in between gnres ad borrows heavily from fusion jazz with touches of psyhadelic rock and lo-fi. The compositions aim to take the listner on a journey through genres, rhythms and worlds, letting the music move you from within.", "start": "2025-08-14T16:30:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-14T17:30:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "1c157563-cf57-4020-b024-7883d2897d94", "typeId": "fecad87f-08cd-48ef-952c-b72fdc3fe775", "tags": []
},{
"id": "87bf070d-068c-453f-892c-ab23588c5508", "place":{"id": "0a759b58-84dc-46c3-9833-4a1c4b80b84c", "name": "Aerial Dome", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "805ca0a6-de05-4fee-a0ea-61602e8a2559", "name": "Aerial", "name_EN":"Aerial", "color": "#92CBFF"}, "name": "Lyra Flow", "name_EN": "Lyra Flow", "name_Secondary": "Dori Podmaniczky", "description": "IG: @dorothypodmaniczky\nCo si s sebou přinést: Tričko s dlouhým rukávem. Prosím, přijďte bez šperků.\n\nWorkshop pro zkušené začínající, mírně pokročilé a pokročilé letecké akrobaty. Bezpečné prostředí, kde se s vámi podělím o své znalosti a zkušenosti s tvůrčí prací ve vzduchu a současným tancem, a také se inspiruji bojovými uměními a jógou. Hlavním cílem kurzu je uvolnit naši kreativitu a odvážně se vyjádřit ve vzduchu co nejbezpečnějším způsobem. Cílem je získat neustále udržované používání plynutí v těle a mysli, které nám umožňuje procházet různými pohybovými kvalitami od podlahy až do vzduchu v rámci jednoho letu. V tomto citlivém procesu vytváříme osobní a jedinečné postavy pomocí našich dovedností. Prostřednictvím pevných materiálů a improvizačních cvičení objevujeme své vlastní možnosti a ty, které nám poskytuje vybavení.", "description_EN": "IG: @dorothypodmaniczky\nWhat to bring:  Long sleeve shirt. Please come without wearing jewellery.\n\nA workshop for experienced beginner, intermediate and advanced aerialists. A safe environment where I share my knowledge and experiences of creative work in the air and contemporary dance, and also inspired by martial arts and yoga. The primary focus of the class is to unleash our creativity and express ourselves boldly in the air in the safest possible way. The goal is to acquire a constantly maintained use of flow in the body and mind that enables us to travel through different movement qualities from the floor all the way gradually to the air within one trip. In this sensitive process, we create personal and unique characters using our skills. Through fixed materials and improvisational exercises, we discover our own possibilities and those provided by the apparatus.", "start": "2025-08-14T16:30:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-14T18:00:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "0a759b58-84dc-46c3-9833-4a1c4b80b84c", "typeId": "805ca0a6-de05-4fee-a0ea-61602e8a2559", "tags": [{"id": "35f1e8bc-7735-43fb-8caa-5d87e940a8b3", "name": "Masterclass", "name_EN":"Masterclass"}]
},{
"id": "889953c7-fc62-47a9-8f48-893adf9a578b", "place":{"id": "78007c5c-0e02-4b1b-b364-86bfedf1ba99", "name": "Circus Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "e7fc379a-08b6-4c55-bf80-ab739a49cb3a", "name": "Všechny tyče", "name_EN":"All staffs", "color": "#7289F0"}, "name": "On staff Acrostaff", "name_EN": "On staff Acrostaff", "name_Secondary": "Elliot Walton", "description": "IG: @elliotcircusarts, Co sebou: Přiveďte si vlastní personál\r\nZkoumání základních akrobatických pohybů s váhou na hůl, pohybů, jako jsou způsoby cestování, kolotoče s variacemi a makaky. Poskytnu spoustu holí – vezměte prosím svého acrostaffa, pokud jej máte.", "description_EN": "IG: @elliotcircusarts, What to bring: Bring your own staff\r\nExploring foundational acrobatic movement with weight bearing on the staff, movements such as traveling modalities, cartwheels with variations and macacos. I will provide a bunch of staffs—please bring your acrostaff if you have one.", "start": "2025-08-16T10:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T12:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "78007c5c-0e02-4b1b-b364-86bfedf1ba99", "typeId": "e7fc379a-08b6-4c55-bf80-ab739a49cb3a", "tags": [{"id": "35f1e8bc-7735-43fb-8caa-5d87e940a8b3", "name": "Masterclass", "name_EN":"Masterclass"}]
},{
"id": "8938f94d-27bf-4f89-99d9-f335a5637b6f", "place":{"id": "f049336d-e8e1-4ef2-bd15-94105f467fce", "name": "Beach", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "1617d663-ed2a-4d11-80e3-a6159dda7ada", "name": "Fans", "name_EN":"Fans", "color": "#ff5252"}, "name": "Kung Fu Fan - beginner choreo", "name_EN": "Kung Fu Fan - beginner choreo", "name_Secondary": "Lydia Nexus", "description": "IG: @lydianexus, Co sebou: Sebe\r\nÚvod do základních pohybů fanoušků Kung Fu. Kung Fu postoje a vzory nohou. Plynulé kombo na hudbu.", "description_EN": "IG: @lydianexus, What to bring: Yourself\r\nIntroduction to basic Kung Fu Fan moves. Kung Fu Stances and foot patterns. Flowy combo to music.", "start": "2025-08-16T12:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T13:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "f049336d-e8e1-4ef2-bd15-94105f467fce", "typeId": "1617d663-ed2a-4d11-80e3-a6159dda7ada", "tags": [{"id": "ba7623dc-5239-49d6-9b7c-5a56d8bf4b02", "name": "Začátečníci", "name_EN":"Beginner"}]
