"id": "9e4b14d5-a8a1-4cf3-b33b-43f5f64b807f", "place":{"id": "11eec21d-ca1d-440c-9222-993490773ee7", "name": "Forest", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "cad9ef0a-f382-406d-85fc-e8a7686b7a4f", "name": "Poi", "name_EN":"Poi", "color": "#b4d576"}, "name": "Related & non related hybrids", "name_EN": "Related & non related hybrids", "name_Secondary": "David ML", "description": "IG: @david___ml, Co sebou: Poi poi poi\r\nIzolace, hybridy, nesouvisející hybridy... Dejte všem těmto pojmům větší smysl a naučte se, jak zajistit, aby vaše poi vypadaly na vaše ruce magneticky. Návod krok za krokem různými způsoby, jak přemýšlet o hybridech a jak je začlenit do svého toku.", "description_EN": "IG: @david___ml, What to bring: Poi poi poi\r\nIsolations, hybrids, non related hybrids... Make more sense of all these concepts and learn how to make your poi look magnetic to your hands. A step-by-step guidance through different ways to think about hybrids and how to incorporate them into your flow.", "start": "2025-08-14T13:30:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-14T15:00:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "11eec21d-ca1d-440c-9222-993490773ee7", "typeId": "cad9ef0a-f382-406d-85fc-e8a7686b7a4f", "tags": [{"id": "35f1e8bc-7735-43fb-8caa-5d87e940a8b3", "name": "Masterclass", "name_EN":"Masterclass"}]
},{
"id": "9ecbe6c6-a8d1-4501-82d7-13fb31906ff8", "place":{"id": "f15dabd2-1383-4338-8a1f-06686ae32ad9", "name": "Psylo Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "1de3301c-fe95-446e-9fcb-b0cd7e056e1d", "name": "Contact ball", "name_EN":"Contact ball", "color": ""}, "name": "Contact Ball + Waving/Animation Fusion", "name_EN": "Contact Ball + Waving/Animation Fusion", "name_Secondary": "Liquid Circus (Alan)", "description": "IG: @liquid.circus, Co sebou: Míč (jakýkoli míč)\r\nV tomto workshopu se naučíme a využijeme prvky z mávání, pukání a animace k animaci kontaktního míčku nebo našich těl kolem něj. Budeme studovat izolace, zastávky, robotické pohyby a pohyb hlíny.", "description_EN": "IG: @liquid.circus, What to bring: A ball (any ball)\r\nIn this workshop we will learn and utilize elements from waving, popping and animation to animate the contact ball or our bodies around it. We will study isolations, stops, robotic movements, and claymotion.", "start": "2025-08-16T13:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T15:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "f15dabd2-1383-4338-8a1f-06686ae32ad9", "typeId": "1de3301c-fe95-446e-9fcb-b0cd7e056e1d", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
},{
"id": "a1f9a5d7-23db-4154-b145-b61d3a5ca0fe", "place":{"id": "1c157563-cf57-4020-b024-7883d2897d94", "name": "Sunset Stage", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "fecad87f-08cd-48ef-952c-b72fdc3fe775", "name": "Live music", "name_EN":"Live music", "color": "#43e90c"}, "name": "Noflipe", "name_EN": "Noflipe", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "NOFLIPE je kapela složená ze sedmi jedinců na okraji společnosti.\r\n\r\nV jejich písních se dozvídáme jejich příběh od vzniku kapely až po objevení toho, kdo se stane jejich největším nepřítelem. V srdci stále povrchnější a nelidštější společnosti zdání nás příběh ponoří do ponuré atmosféry DullTown. Sedm postav pak zažije svět na své cestě: Doktor E, strážce stínu, Flush, „smeť společnosti“, Natch, podvodník, Rudy Tiger, kterému nic nebrání ve vytvoření, Pew, slepý, SLow, „neobvyklý“ a TokToc, navzdory své amnézii. Je čas vstoupit do vesmíru NOFLIPE!\r\n\r\nNOFLIPE jsou také dvě EP a tři alba vlastní produkce s hudbou ovlivněnou kapelami jako Beastie Boys, Transplants, Stupeflip, Puppetmastaz, Funkadelic ou nebo Bad Brains. To vše s estetickým aspektem inspirovaným komiksy jako Métal Hurlant nebo komiksovými ilustrátory jako Franck Miller nebo Robert Crumb. Vytvářením svého vesmíru krok za krokem NOFLIPE nejprve projevili svou energii na jevišti s obzvláště komunikativní dynamikou!\r\n\r\n", "description_EN": "NOFLIPE is a band composed of seven individuals on the fringe of society.\r\n\r\nIn their songs, we learn their story from the origin of the band to the discovery of the one who will become their worst enemy. At the heart of an increasingly superficial and inhuman society of appearances, the story plunges us in the gloomy atmosphere of DullTown. Then, the seven characters experience the world on their way : Doctor E, the vigilante of shade, Flush, the « scum of the society », Natch, the swindler, Rudy Tiger that nothing prevents from creating, Pew, the blind, SLow, the « offbeat » and TokToc, amnesiac in spite of himself. It’s time to enter the NOFLIPE Universe !\r\n\r\nNOFLIPE is also two EP and three albums autoproduced with a music influenced by bands like Beastie Boys, Transplants, Stupeflip, Puppetmastaz, Funkadelic ou or Bad Brains. All of this with an aesthetic aspect inspired by comics like Métal Hurlant or comics illustrators such as Franck Miller or Robert Crumb. By building their universe step by step, NOFLIPE have first transpired their energy on stage with a particularly communicative dynamism !\r\n\r\n", "start": "2025-08-14T21:30:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-14T22:30:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "1c157563-cf57-4020-b024-7883d2897d94", "typeId": "fecad87f-08cd-48ef-952c-b72fdc3fe775", "tags": []
