"id": "a2878e6b-c3a2-4f8a-9616-0b3239ef9001", "place":{"id": "0a759b58-84dc-46c3-9833-4a1c4b80b84c", "name": "Aerial Dome", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "805ca0a6-de05-4fee-a0ea-61602e8a2559", "name": "Aerial", "name_EN":"Aerial", "color": "#92CBFF"}, "name": "Aerialhoop Flow", "name_EN": "Aerialhoop Flow", "name_Secondary": "Tobia Florence", "description": "IG: @tobia.florences, Co sebou: Dlouhé, těsné legíny\r\nPředstavím vám plynulou sekvenci na obruči Aerial. Začneme specifickým Warmup and Conditioning tréninkem pro leteckou akrobacii se zaměřením zejména na ramena, jádro a úchop. Poté budeme pracovat na figurách a přechodech, které povedou k plynulé choreografii. Na závěr vám dám výtvarnou inspiraci pohybových kvalit, se kterými si pohrajeme a vneseme do naší sekvence charakter a plynulost. Všechny úrovně jsou vítány, protože toto choreo lze provádět v různých úrovních obtížnosti.", "description_EN": "IG: @tobia.florences, What to bring: Long, tight leggings\r\nI will introduce you a flowy sequence on the Aerial hoop. We will start with a specific Warmup and Conditioning training for Aerial acrobatics, focusing especially on shoulders, core and grip. Then we will work on figures and transitions which will lead to a fluent choreography. Towards the end I will give you some artistic inspiration of movement qualities, with which we will play around and bring character and flow into our sequence. All levels are welcome, because this choreo can be performed in different levels of difficulty.", "start": "2025-08-16T13:30:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T15:00:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "0a759b58-84dc-46c3-9833-4a1c4b80b84c", "typeId": "805ca0a6-de05-4fee-a0ea-61602e8a2559", "tags": [{"id": "35f1e8bc-7735-43fb-8caa-5d87e940a8b3", "name": "Masterclass", "name_EN":"Masterclass"}]
},{"id": "a297f4cd-1ee1-4634-8fe7-14a34a2e32b5", "place":{"id": "5f32ef9b-d255-4420-95be-101ba551381c", "name": "Dock", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "Zí", "name_EN": "Zí", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "", "description_EN": "", "start": "2025-08-17T22:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-17T23:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "5f32ef9b-d255-4420-95be-101ba551381c", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []},{
"id": "a58f5ef4-c700-4266-911d-902e58ec6be6", "place":{"id": "f15dabd2-1383-4338-8a1f-06686ae32ad9", "name": "Psylo Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "64f26ee0-a3e5-422f-9a69-145c81e2d1b9", "name": "ALL PROPS", "name_EN":"ALL PROPS", "color": ""}, "name": "How to dance with your prop", "name_EN": "How to dance with your prop", "name_Secondary": "Anette Aventurine", "description": "IG: @AnetteAventurine, Co sebou: Rekvizity dle výběru\r\nZačnu skupinovou reflexí, kde se podělíme o vlastní zkušenosti s tancem a výrazným pohybem. Poté prozkoumáme letadla, stezky a kde snadno přecházet mezi pohyblivým trikem a statickým trikem.", "description_EN": "IG: @AnetteAventurine, What to bring: Props of choice\r\nI'll start with group reflecting, where we'll share our own experience with dance and expressive movement. Then we'll explore the planes, trails and where to easily transition between a moving trick and a static one.", "start": "2025-08-15T10:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T12:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "f15dabd2-1383-4338-8a1f-06686ae32ad9", "typeId": "64f26ee0-a3e5-422f-9a69-145c81e2d1b9", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
},{
"id": "a5a3332d-1200-4497-9647-fb1797918091", "place":{"id": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "name": "Spinning @ Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "name": "Tanec/Pohyb", "name_EN":"Dance/Movement", "color": "#E3D08C"}, "name": "Gloving and Fingerdancing", "name_EN": "Gloving and Fingerdancing", "name_Secondary": "Jayce", "description": "IG: @tulip.visual\nCo si s sebou vzít: jednu nebo dvě ruce ;)\n\nCo je gloving/fingerdance? Zní to trochu divně... Gloving je obecně individuální, relativně ezoterický ruční tanec, který se odehrává blízko diváka/tváře. Po příjemném zahřátí a protažení se budeme zabývat základními koncepty, které vám pomohou začít vaši vlastní cestu: fingerrolly, whipy a stacking, abychom jmenovali alespoň některé, a také několika pokročilými nápady a koncepty, které byste si měli později na své cestě pamatovat. Nic z toho pravděpodobně nedá smysl, takže pokud jste zvědaví, přijďte a pomozte oživit toto umírající flow umění!", "description_EN": "IG: @tulip.visual\nWhat to bring: one or two hands ;)\n\nWhat is gloving/fingerdance? Sounds kinda weird... Gloving is a generally one on one, relatively esoteric hand dance that takes place close the viewer/'s face. After a nice warmup and some stretches, we'll be covering the foundational concepts to help you start your own journey: fingerolls, whips and stacking to name a few and some advanced ideas and concepts to keep in mind later down your journey. None of this will probably make sense so just come along if you're curious and help revive this dying flow art! \n\n", "start": "2025-08-16T15:00:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T16:30:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "typeId": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "tags": []
},{
"id": "a6635da8-d048-42a2-a7f5-ff4f49ca6812", "place":{"id": "1c157563-cf57-4020-b024-7883d2897d94", "name": "Sunset Stage", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "fecad87f-08cd-48ef-952c-b72fdc3fe775", "name": "Live music", "name_EN":"Live music", "color": "#43e90c"}, "name": "Omnion", "name_EN": "Omnion", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Omnion (Evropa / Česko / Praha) je sólový projekt skladatele, multiinstrumentalisty a hráče na tabla Tomáše Reindla. Omnion definuje svůj osobitý styl „OmniBeat“ jako jedinečnou kombinaci živých nástrojů s interaktivní elektronikou. Jeho jasně rozpoznatelný styl kombinuje inspiraci ze starověkých kořenů hudby Východu i Západu spolu se sofistikovanými přístupy k živému zpracování a smyčkování. Jeho záběr sahá napříč kategoriemi od elektroakustického downtempa, přes world-beat až po extatickou taneční hudbu s pozitivními hlubokými vibracemi. Kromě klubových a festivalových vystoupení vystupovali Omnion také na řadě církevních míst s meditativním programem. Omnion tvoří hudbu nejen k poslechu, ale také k tanci, což považuje za archetypální lidskou potřebu.\r\n\r\nNástroje a techniky: smyčkování a zpracování v reálném čase, tabla, klarinet, beat-box, zpěv, alikvotní zpěv, didjeridu, kanjira, trom-bone, koncovka flétna, bluesová harmonika\r\n\r\n", "description_EN": "Omnion (Europe / Czechia / Prague) is a solo project of composer, multi-instrumentalist and tabla player Tomáš Reindl. Omnion defines its distinctive “OmniBeat” style as a unique combination of live instruments with interactive electronics. His clearly recognizable style combines inspiration from the ancient roots of music of both East and West, along with sophisticated approaches to live processing and looping. His range extends across categories from electro-acoustic downtempo, to world-beat, to ecstatic dance music with positive deep vibes. In addition to club and festival appearances, Omnion has also performed in a number of church venues, with a meditative program. Omnion creates music not only to listen to, but also to dance, which he considers an archetypal human need.\r\n\r\nInstruments and techniques: realtime looping & processing, tabla, clarinet, beat-box, voice, overtone singing, didjeridu, kanjira, trom-bone, koncovka flute, blues harmonica\r\n\r\n", "start": "2025-08-16T15:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T16:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "1c157563-cf57-4020-b024-7883d2897d94", "typeId": "fecad87f-08cd-48ef-952c-b72fdc3fe775", "tags": []
},{
"id": "a8b2c73d-731c-4a85-865c-1a3a602ebbd2", "place":{"id": "7f56de3c-ae91-4bc3-8d2c-a9b4fd401b18", "name": "Tchaiovna", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "fecad87f-08cd-48ef-952c-b72fdc3fe775", "name": "Live music", "name_EN":"Live music", "color": "#43e90c"}, "name": "Der Šenstr Gob", "name_EN": "Der Šenstr Gob", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Der Šenster Gob je akustická kapela z Prahy hrající cikánskou, židovskou a balkánskou hudbu, která cestuje po celé Evropě v romantickém zeleném dřevěném karavanu. Jejich styl se liší od starých klezmerových melodií po novější cikánské tradiční jazzové melodie a písně. Hrají si s energií a invencí, ale také hodně ctí tradice. Přes den je občas můžete potkat na buskingu v ulicích krásných městeček a třeba večer zahrají ve vašem oblíbeném baru nebo koncertním sále. Přijďte se na ně podívat naživo a nebudete litovat!\r\n", "description_EN": "Der Šenster Gob is an acoustic band from Prague playing Gypsy, Jewish and Balkan music, travelling all around Europe in a romantic green wooden caravan. Their style varies from old klezmer tunes to newer Gypsy trad-jazz tunes and songs. They play with energy and invention, but they also pay a lot of respect to tradition. During the day, you can sometimes meet them busking on the streets of beautiful towns, and maybe in the evening they will play in your favourite bar or concert hall. Come to see them live and you won’t regret!\r\n", "start": "2025-08-17T21:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-17T22:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "7f56de3c-ae91-4bc3-8d2c-a9b4fd401b18", "typeId": "fecad87f-08cd-48ef-952c-b72fdc3fe775", "tags": []
},{
"id": "a8edee9b-b610-41f6-bbfa-241d28cae1d4", "place":{"id": "1c157563-cf57-4020-b024-7883d2897d94", "name": "Sunset Stage", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "fecad87f-08cd-48ef-952c-b72fdc3fe775", "name": "Live music", "name_EN":"Live music", "color": "#43e90c"}, "name": "MATSUMOTO ZOKU BAND", "name_EN": "MATSUMOTO ZOKU BAND", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Organický instrumentální hudební kvartet MATSUMOTO ZOKU BAND sklidil uznání pro svůj inovativní zvuk a strhující výkony.\r\n\r\nKapela vznikla v Melbourne v roce 2013 a původně ji tvořili REO MATSUMOTO (HandPan, Beatbox a Percussion) a Koji Matsumoto (HandPan a Didgeridoo). V roce 2022 se sestava rozšířila o talentované KENTA HAYASHI (kytara) a Nory (baskytara), čímž vznikl tým snů, který pozvedá jejich zvuk do nových výšin.\r\n\r\nMATSUMOTO ZOKU BAND hladce spojuje městské Human Beats s okouzlujícími melodiemi HandPan a Didgeridoo a vytváří fascinující vlnu groove. V jejich hudbě se mísí zvuky kytary a baskytary s funkem a rockem a vytváří živý, ale psychedelický zážitek, který posluchače vtáhne do organické taneční hudby. Kapela čerpá inspiraci z různých žánrů, včetně Psy-trance, ChillBeats, Hip-hopu a Rocku, a neustále hledá inovace prostřednictvím nových zvuků.\r\n\r\nMATSUMOTO ZOKU BAND uchvátil publikum ve 14 zemích a 41 městech. Svou cestu zahájili jako první japonský umělec, který vystoupil na Dragon Nest Stage na festivalu Ozora v Maďarsku, kde svůj talent předvedli sedmkrát od roku 2013. Jejich elektrizující výkony a jedinečný zvuk nepřestávají uchvacovat fanoušky a upevňují MATSUMOTO ZOKU BAND jako výjimečný počin na globální hudební scéně.\r\n", "description_EN": "The organic instrumental music quartet MATSUMOTO ZOKU BAND has garnered acclaim for its innovative sound and captivating performances.\r\n\r\nFormed in Melbourne in 2013, the band initially consisted of REO MATSUMOTO (HandPan, Beatbox, and Percussion) and Koji Matsumoto (HandPan and Didgeridoo). In 2022, the lineup expanded to include the talented KENTA HAYASHI (Guitar) and Nory (Bass), creating a dream team that elevates their sound to new heights.\r\n\r\nMATSUMOTO ZOKU BAND seamlessly merges urban Human Beats with the enchanting melodies of the HandPan and Didgeridoo, crafting a mesmerizing wave of groove. Their music blends the sounds of guitar and bass with funk and rock, creating a vibrant yet psychedelic experience that immerses listeners in the Organic Dance Music. Drawing inspiration from various genres, including Psy-trance, ChillBeats, Hip-hop, and Rock, the band is always seeking innovation through new sounds.\r\n\r\nMATSUMOTO ZOKU BAND has mesmerized audiences across 14 countries and 41 cities. They began their journey as the first Japanese artist to perform on the Dragon Nest Stage at the Ozora Festival in Hungary, showcasing their talent there seven times since 2013. Their electrifying performances and unique sound continue to captivate fans, solidifying MATSUMOTO ZOKU BAND as a standout act in the global music scene.\r\n", "start": "2025-08-16T18:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T19:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "1c157563-cf57-4020-b024-7883d2897d94", "typeId": "fecad87f-08cd-48ef-952c-b72fdc3fe775", "tags": []
},{
"id": "a91a1df1-533c-47d1-b90f-3a49acb76a86", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "BZarr", "name_EN": "BZarr", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Bzarr – je příjemné být zpět na jednom z nejlepších festivalů v Evropě! Přinášíme vám svěží basovou hudbu z různých částí světa.  \r\nNechte tu věc trochu divnou. Buďte bizarní!", "description_EN": "Bzarr - its nice to be back for one of the coolest festivals in Europe ! Bringing some fresh bass music from different parts of the world for you.  \r\nKeep thing little bit weird. Be Bizarre!", "start": "2025-08-15T04:30:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T06:00:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []
