"id": "a9bcb1b3-709d-4cf3-96cb-cde7ed3cac48", "place":{"id": "5db9a114-6861-494a-9ba5-abc0f93ac6e8", "name": "Meadow", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "name": "Tanec/Pohyb", "name_EN":"Dance/Movement", "color": "#E3D08C"}, "name": "Movement Massage & Body Flow", "name_EN": "Movement Massage & Body Flow", "name_Secondary": "Paulina - Poi Li Wu", "description": "IG: @poi_li_wu, Co sebou: S sebou si vezměte volné pohodlné oblečení, ponožky nebo naboso.\r\nPohybová masáž – následujte moji techniku sebemasáže prostřednictvím záměrného i intuitivního pohybu – introspektivní zkoumání těla. Použijte jemné protažení a \"laskavý\" tlak podél příjemného a kreativního zážitku tady a teď. Ponořením se do fyzických vjemů vnímáte a postupně rozšiřujete své rozsahy a učíte se vlastním způsobům sebeobsluhy v pohybu. Po cestě zpracujte svůj vnitřní stav a pracujte přes napětí při hledání uvolnění\r\n", "description_EN": "IG: @poi_li_wu, What to bring: Bring loose comfy clothes, socks or barefoot.\nMovement Massage & Body Flow - we start with an introduction to my technique of self-massage through both intentional & intuitive movement - an introspective body exploration. The intention is to have a pleasant and creative experience in the here & now using gentle stretches and kind pressure on your body. By immersing in physical sensations you perceive and gradually expand your ranges and learn your own ways of self-care in movement. Along the way, it is your chance to process your internal state and work through tensions in search of release. With a smooth transition, we enter Body Flow, a playful, explorative journey inspired by flow arts with your own body as your prop. Play with momentum, orientation & balance. Combine in search of flow. Explore geometrical dependencies between body parts to practice transitions and develop intuitive reactions to unexpected movement evolutions. Find inspiration for your improvisation and/or performance in connection with music's dynamics\n", "start": "2025-08-17T16:30:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-17T18:00:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "5db9a114-6861-494a-9ba5-abc0f93ac6e8", "typeId": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
