"id": "b5a4b5af-5ebb-4230-a758-bc7f51fb35da", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "Blasphemix", "name_EN": "Blasphemix", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Tomuto muži není nic svaté. Nespoutaný a radikální Blasphemix čerpá z hudby, kterou dovedně přepracoval do svého osobního kultu – rozmazává žánrové linie a vzdoruje konvencím. Společné vlákno? Vždy to „něco jisté“... a hluboký, nezaměnitelný low-end. To je to, co definuje Blasphemix: hudební rozmanitost. Jeho sety jsou divoké, žánrově ohýbající jízdy – malé horské dráhy v mnoha příchutích, které basová hudba nabízí. Prostě Baesst!", "description_EN": "Nothing is sacred to this man. Unrestrained and radical, Blasphemix draws from music he’s skillfully redistilled into his own personal cult—blurring genre lines and defying convention. The common thread? Always that “certain something”… and a deep, unmistakable low-end. That’s what defines Blasphemix: musical diversity. His sets are wild, genre-bending rides—little rollercoasters through the many flavors Bass music has to offer. Just the Baesst!", "start": "2025-08-18T02:30:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-18T04:00:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []
},{
"id": "b86a12f8-0df7-47c4-adcb-38f132872a44", "place":{"id": "5f32ef9b-d255-4420-95be-101ba551381c", "name": "Dock", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "FLeX", "name_EN": "FLeX", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Hudba dominuje soukromému životu FLeX již více než 20 let. Počínaje ranými verzemi Propellerheads, Reason a Ableton strávil velkou část svého mládí ve studiích přátel a snažil se soustředit hudební vlivy 90. let do své vlastní hudby a poté je prezentovat v živých vystoupeních. Přechod k DJingu následoval v roce 2018. Od té doby jeho hudební vášeň spočívala v tom, že trávil hodiny a hodiny prokopáváním se na Bandcampu za hudbou ze široké škály žánrů a poté z ní kurátoroval do setů. Středem zájmu jsou obvykle různorodé skladby, které jsou propojeny plynulými přechody a společnou nití.\r\n", "description_EN": "Music has dominated FLeX’s private life for over 20 years now. Starting with early versions of Propellerheads, Reason and Ableton, he spent large parts of his youth in friends’ studios and tried to concentrate the musical influences of the 90s into his own music and then present it in live acts. The switch to DJing followed in 2018. Since then, his musical passion has consisted of spending hours and hours digging through Bandcamp for music from a wide range of genres and then curating them into sets. The focus is usually on diverse tracks that are connected by flowing transitions and a common thread.\r\n", "start": "2025-08-16T02:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T04:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "5f32ef9b-d255-4420-95be-101ba551381c", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []
},{
"id": "b99799f7-fed2-40a1-8e7d-94544e135757", "place":{"id": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "name": "Spinning @ Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "name": "Tanec/Pohyb", "name_EN":"Dance/Movement", "color": "#E3D08C"}, "name": "Shuffle Dance", "name_EN": "Shuffle Dance", "name_Secondary": "Stelina", "description": "IG: @stelina_bckv\nCo si s sebou vzít: vodu\n\nV tomto dynamickém a energickém workshopu se vžijte do rytmu a prozkoumejte základy shuffle tance!\n\nNaučíte se ikonické nohy jako Running Man, T-Step a jejich variace a zároveň si zlepšíte koordinaci, muzikálnost a plynulost.\nAť už jste začátečník, nebo si chcete vylepšit techniku, tento workshop je o propojení s rytmem a zábavě s pohybem. Žádné rekvizity nejsou potřeba, pouze pokud se chcete sami vyzvat :)\nPřijďte připraveni na pohyb, pot a shuffle!", "description_EN": "IG: @stelina_bckv\nWhat to bring: water\n\nStep into the rhythm and explore the fundamentals of shuffle dancing in this dynamic and energetic workshop! \nYou'll learn iconic footwork like the Running Man, T-Step, and their variations, while improving coordination, musicality, and flow.\nWhether you're a beginner or looking to polish your technique, this workshop is all about connecting to the beat and having fun with movement. No props required, only if you want to challenge yourself :) \nCome ready to move, sweat, and shuffle!\n\n\n", "start": "2025-08-16T16:30:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T18:00:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "typeId": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "tags": []
},{
"id": "baec9b1f-745d-4d75-a719-3d07665f6ce2", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "0b6cd902-494b-454b-a291-aa0fb3a0f7d5", "name": "Rope dart", "name_EN":"Rope dart", "color": "#F7DF69"}, "name": "Introduction to the Dark Plane", "name_EN": "Introduction to the Dark Plane", "name_Secondary": "Jonas Meiser", "description": "IG: @jonas_fire.artist, Co sebou: Šipka na laně\r\nThe Dark Plane popisuje každou techniku, která začíná celým lanem za zády. V tomto workshopu vás naučím tři různé vstupy do Temné roviny a tři různé východy z ní. Každý z nich lze vzájemně kombinovat, takže po tomto workshopu budete mít velké množství nových možných sekvencí!", "description_EN": "IG: @jonas_fire.artist, What to bring: Rope dart\r\nThe Dark Plane describes every technique, which starts with the whole rope behind the back. In this workshop I'll teach you three different entrances into the Dark Plane and three different exits from it. Each of those can be combined with each other, so after this workshop you'll have a great number of new possible sequences!", "start": "2025-08-17T16:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-17T18:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "0b6cd902-494b-454b-a291-aa0fb3a0f7d5", "tags": [{"id": "45d628ea-15e5-444b-a8a6-b624d86d002b", "name": "Středně pokročilí", "name_EN":"Intermediate"}]
},{
"id": "bcad9c75-5b9a-414b-9cea-823714c71b44", "place":{"id": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "name": "Spinning @ Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "name": "Tanec/Pohyb", "name_EN":"Dance/Movement", "color": "#E3D08C"}, "name": "Dance Flow", "name_EN": "Dance Flow", "name_Secondary": "danzasempre", "description": "Obecné rozcvičení, technické prvky ze současnosti a analýza pohybu.\nZaměření: uvědomění si pohybu, technická přesnost pohybu, láska.", "description_EN": "General warm-up, technical elements from contemporary and movement analysis. \nFocus: movement awareness, technical movement precision, love. ", "start": "2025-08-14T16:30:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-14T18:00:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "typeId": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "tags": []
