"id": "c764c2ba-4ab1-47b2-ab9a-ca37169e1cf4", "place":{"id": "f15dabd2-1383-4338-8a1f-06686ae32ad9", "name": "Psylo Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "e7fc379a-08b6-4c55-bf80-ab739a49cb3a", "name": "Všechny tyče", "name_EN":"All staffs", "color": "#7289F0"}, "name": "Flowersticks become a Wizzard!", "name_EN": "Flowersticks become a Wizzard!", "name_Secondary": "FocusFire", "description": "IG: @focusfire_flowarts, Co sebou: Mám spoustu cvičných květinových tyčinek pro každého\r\nPřineste svůj hocusfocus a zhmotněte ho do mnoha triků s květinami! V tomto workshopu se seznámíme se základními koncepty, jako je Buzsaw, Infinity Roll a Bellcatch, jako vstupní bod, odkud zkoumáme jejich variace. Nudí vás dělat všechno rukama? Do našeho toku zapojujeme různé části těla a prvek pohybu těla.", "description_EN": "IG: @focusfire_flowarts, What to bring: I have plenty of practice flowersticks for everyone\r\nBring your hocusfocus and materialise it into many flowerstick tricks! In this workshop we learn about basic concepts like Buzsaw, Infinity Roll, and Bellcatch, as an entry point from where we explore their variations. Bored of doing everything with your hands? We incorporate different body parts and the element of bodymovement in our flow.", "start": "2025-08-15T15:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T16:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "f15dabd2-1383-4338-8a1f-06686ae32ad9", "typeId": "e7fc379a-08b6-4c55-bf80-ab739a49cb3a", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
},{
"id": "c8043b6e-d182-4255-9d4d-cc4309337192", "place":{"id": "7f56de3c-ae91-4bc3-8d2c-a9b4fd401b18", "name": "Tchaiovna", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "fecad87f-08cd-48ef-952c-b72fdc3fe775", "name": "Live music", "name_EN":"Live music", "color": "#43e90c"}, "name": "Table Mountain String Band", "name_EN": "Table Mountain String Band", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Table Mountain String Band je čtyřčlenná skupina sídlící mimo Prahu v České republice, hrající energické, staré americké housle a lidové písně. Kapela získala své jméno podle oblasti nedaleko místa, kde Nick Jennings vyrostl, v severní Kalifornii. Spolu se svou ženou Eliškou Jennings, rodilou Pražankou, hraje na kytaru Clawhammer banjo. Propletené vokální harmonie a silné rytmy páru položily základy kapely. K nim se připojuje Ludvík Jacek, rovněž z Prahy, který odmala hraje na housle a rozvíjí všestranný a okouzlující zvuk. Petr Pijáček pochází z Moravy a hraje na basu v řadě různých skupin s pevným základem v moravském folklóru, jeho taneční basové linky doplňují jejich zvuk a utužují skupinu.", "description_EN": "Table Mountain String Band is a four-piece group based out of Prague, Czech Republic, playing high-energy, driving old-time American fiddle tunes and folk songs. The band gets its name from an area not far from where Nick Jennings grew up, in Northern California. He fronts the group, playing clawhammer banjo, along with his wife Eliška Jennings, a native of Prague, on guitar. The couple’s intertwined vocal harmonies and strong rhythms lay the groundwork for the band. They are joined by Ludvík Jacek, also from Prague, who has played fiddle from an early age, developing a versatile and enchanting sound. Hailing from Moravia, Petr Pijáček plays bass in a number of different groups with a solid foundation in Moravian folklore, his dancing bass lines fill out their sound, and solidify the group.", "start": "2025-08-15T16:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T17:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "7f56de3c-ae91-4bc3-8d2c-a9b4fd401b18", "typeId": "fecad87f-08cd-48ef-952c-b72fdc3fe775", "tags": []
