"id": "c90b66b0-763d-4e86-abeb-5a4774e27ba3", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "2ed042bf-ef98-4293-8cf5-663007bd2911", "name": "Hoops", "name_EN":"Hoops", "color": "#ED76B0"}, "name": "Acrobatic Movement with Hoops", "name_EN": "Acrobatic Movement with Hoops", "name_Secondary": "Aimée", "description": "IG: @Aimeelunefleur_performer, Co sebou: Obruče\r\nPřipravte se na plné triky na vysoké úrovni! Tato lekce se ponoří do pokročilé techniky obruče, která kombinuje statické a dynamické akrobatické pohyby s plynulou manipulací s obručemi. Očekávejte rychlé sezení zaměřené na sílu, kontrolu a kreativitu v pohybu.\r\n", "description_EN": "IG: @Aimeelunefleur_performer, What to bring: Hoops\r\nGet ready for full-power, high-level tricks! This class dives into advanced hoop technique, combining static and dynamic acrobatic movements with fluid hoop manipulation. Expect a fast-paced session focused on strength, control, and creativity in motion.\r\n", "start": "2025-08-17T15:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-17T16:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "2ed042bf-ef98-4293-8cf5-663007bd2911", "tags": [{"id": "a9a103c8-c8bf-4e98-9dce-ddada98d71c1", "name": "Pokročilí", "name_EN":"Advanced"}]
},{
"id": "c912b838-bd45-405c-83cd-d46f7a4e73f2", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "2ed042bf-ef98-4293-8cf5-663007bd2911", "name": "Hoops", "name_EN":"Hoops", "color": "#ED76B0"}, "name": "All level hoop combo", "name_EN": "All level hoop combo", "name_Secondary": "Yam Oz", "description": "IG: @yamoztattoos, Co sebou: Obruč\r\n", "description_EN": "IG: @yamoztattoos, What to bring: Hoop\r\nJoin me for a fun and dynamic all-levels hula hoop workshop! In this session, we’ll explore a playful and stylish hoop combination that blends smooth transitions with eye-catching tricks. You'll learn new moves, refine your flow, and add some impressive sequences to your repertoire. We’ll break everything down step by step, so you can find your own groove and make the combo your own. Bring your hoop, your energy, and get ready to spin!", "start": "2025-08-16T15:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T16:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "2ed042bf-ef98-4293-8cf5-663007bd2911", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
},{"id": "ca5791ba-33a1-40c0-acd6-69540a4fd7a0", "place":{"id": "5db9a114-6861-494a-9ba5-abc0f93ac6e8", "name": "Meadow", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "cad9ef0a-f382-406d-85fc-e8a7686b7a4f", "name": "Poi", "name_EN":"Poi", "color": "#b4d576"}, "name": "Plug and play with Same Time and Hybrid variations", "name_EN": "Plug and play with Same Time and Hybrid variations", "name_Secondary": "Matthieu", "description": "", "description_EN": "\r\n", "start": "2025-08-15T12:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T13:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "5db9a114-6861-494a-9ba5-abc0f93ac6e8", "typeId": "cad9ef0a-f382-406d-85fc-e8a7686b7a4f", "tags": []},{
"id": "ccdb3aec-a8d8-4279-940b-a81b2091b239", "place":{"id": "78007c5c-0e02-4b1b-b364-86bfedf1ba99", "name": "Circus Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "eb6f9406-ec4e-4362-bc82-4a0e494fb189", "name": "Show", "name_EN":"Show", "color": "#e99998"}, "name": "Van-kim Tran & Cyrille Humen: Cie Monad", "name_EN": "Van-kim Tran & Cyrille Humen: Cie Monad", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "V tomto představení si budeme protiřečit\r\nBudeme se snažit učinit neviditelné viditelným,\r\nSdílet to, co se děje uvnitř, s vnějškem.\r\nZa méně než hodinu necháme rezonovat ticho a podělíme se o chuť věčnosti.\r\nTěla se budou neustále otáčet.\r\nA přesto někdy budou nehybné.\r\nV tomto duetu budeme tři.\r\nNebude chybět žonglování.\r\n\r\nQuadrifrontal creation, 2019\r\nKejklíř a tanečník : Cyrille Humen\r\nŽonglér a tanečník: Van-Kim Tran\r\nRežie: Eric Longequel\r\nManažer rezervace: Virginie Bernad\r\nAdministrativní a výrobní manažer : Céline Abadie\r\nProdukce: Compagnie Monad\r\nRezidence a podpora: La Maison des Jonglages – Scène Conventionnée La Courneuve (93), Pôle régional Cirque Le Mans (72), Collectif des possibles (68), Archaos – Národní cirkus Pôle – Marseille (13)\r\n\r\n\r\n", "description_EN": "In this performance, we will contradict ourselves\r\nWe will seek to make the invisible visible,\r\nTo share what!s happening inside with the outside.\r\nWe will make silence resonate and share a taste of eternity in less than an hour.\r\nBodies will constantly turn.\r\nAnd yet, at times, they will be still.\r\nIn this duet, we will be three.\r\nJuggling will be present.\r\n\r\nQuadrifrontal creation, 2019\r\nJuggler and dancer : Cyrille Humen\r\nJuggler and dancer : Van-Kim Tran\r\nDirector: Eric Longequel\r\nBooking Manager : Virginie Bernad\r\nAdministration and production manager : Céline Abadie\r\nProduction : Compagnie Monad\r\nResidencies and supports : La Maison des Jonglages – Scène Conventionnée La Courneuve (93), Pôle régional Cirque Le Mans (72), Collectif des possibles (68), Archaos – Pôle National Cirque – Marseille (13)\r\n\r\n", "start": "2025-08-15T19:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T20:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "78007c5c-0e02-4b1b-b364-86bfedf1ba99", "typeId": "eb6f9406-ec4e-4362-bc82-4a0e494fb189", "tags": []
},{
"id": "cf72126f-2185-433e-a9fe-16f39129d71f", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "e7fc379a-08b6-4c55-bf80-ab739a49cb3a", "name": "Všechny tyče", "name_EN":"All staffs", "color": "#7289F0"}, "name": "Introduction to acrobatic contact staff", "name_EN": "Introduction to acrobatic contact staff", "name_Secondary": "Elliot Walton", "description": "IG: @elliotcircusarts, Co sebou: Přiveďte si vlastní personál\r\nZkoumání balančních bodů s kontaktním personálem a akrobatický pohyb od základu, zakončení nekonečnými válečkovými maticovými kolečky.", "description_EN": "IG: @elliotcircusarts, What to bring: Bring your own staff\r\nExploring balance points with contact staff and acrobatic movement from the ground up, finishing with infinity roll matrix cartwheels.", "start": "2025-08-14T16:30:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-14T18:00:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "e7fc379a-08b6-4c55-bf80-ab739a49cb3a", "tags": [{"id": "ba7623dc-5239-49d6-9b7c-5a56d8bf4b02", "name": "Začátečníci", "name_EN":"Beginner"}]
},{
"id": "d0e5f1e9-fbca-41b9-a7c0-402d387164d5", "place":{"id": "f15dabd2-1383-4338-8a1f-06686ae32ad9", "name": "Psylo Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "e7fc379a-08b6-4c55-bf80-ab739a49cb3a", "name": "Všechny tyče", "name_EN":"All staffs", "color": "#7289F0"}, "name": "Double staff introduction", "name_EN": "Double staff introduction", "name_Secondary": "Roberto Morales", "description": "IG: @espejoastral, Co sebou: Doublestaff\r\nTento workshop je určen pro začátečníky se zájmem o dvojitý personál.\r\nProzkoumáme tři základní způsoby pohybu: spin, házení a anti-spin.\r\nAť už teprve začínáte, nebo si chcete vybudovat pevné základy, tato třída vás hravým a přístupným způsobem krok za krokem provede základy.", "description_EN": "IG: @espejoastral, What to bring: Doublestaff\r\nThis workshop is designed for beginners interested in double staff.\r\nWe’ll explore three fundamental modes of movement: spin, throws, and anti-spin.\r\nWhether you're just starting out or looking to build a strong foundation, this class will guide you step by step through the basics in a playful and accessible way.", "start": "2025-08-15T16:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T18:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "f15dabd2-1383-4338-8a1f-06686ae32ad9", "typeId": "e7fc379a-08b6-4c55-bf80-ab739a49cb3a", "tags": [{"id": "ba7623dc-5239-49d6-9b7c-5a56d8bf4b02", "name": "Začátečníci", "name_EN":"Beginner"}]
},{
"id": "d272d8aa-2fa4-4867-a808-2fb89f516ab9", "place":{"id": "f15dabd2-1383-4338-8a1f-06686ae32ad9", "name": "Psylo Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "e6399636-5cad-48e6-9fe3-d895073abedb", "name": "Buugeng", "name_EN":"Buugeng", "color": ""}, "name": "Enter the Buugeng", "name_EN": "Enter the Buugeng", "name_Secondary": "Filip Haralanov", "description": "IG: @filipharalanov_fire_and_circus, Co sebou: Rekvizity a pohodlné oblečení\r\nNěkteré základní pohyby kromě točení prstů", "description_EN": "IG: @filipharalanov_fire_and_circus, What to bring: Props and comfortable clothes\r\nSome basic movements beside finger spinning", "start": "2025-08-15T13:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T15:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "f15dabd2-1383-4338-8a1f-06686ae32ad9", "typeId": "e6399636-5cad-48e6-9fe3-d895073abedb", "tags": [{"id": "ba7623dc-5239-49d6-9b7c-5a56d8bf4b02", "name": "Začátečníci", "name_EN":"Beginner"}]
