"id": "d5f83944-e15b-4430-81dd-6203acde74bc", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "Blazing Sparrow", "name_EN": "Blazing Sparrow", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "The Blazing Sparrow přináší kmenové beaty, krásné melodie, posilující příběhy a hluboké basové linky do ohnivých a plynových prostor. Neomezená umělými hranicemi žánrů a BPM spojuje skladby do souborů, které působí jako rituál – intimní, prvotní a podmanivé. \r\n\r\nJejí cesta začala hlasem a kompozicí, než se rozšířila do tance a plynutí. Nyní, za palubou, Blazing Sparrow nasměruje svého tanečního ducha a lásku ke zpěvu do DJ setů, které jsou jak uzemňující, tak transcendentní. Její hudba přemosťuje pulzující podsvětí basů se zářivými melodickými vlákny, zve tanečníky a flow artisty do prostoru ztělesněného osvobození.\r\n\r\n", "description_EN": "The Blazing Sparrow brings tribal beats, beautiful melodies, empowering stories, and deep basslines to fire & flow spaces. Unlimited by the artificial boundaries of genres and BPM, she fuses tracks into sets that feel like ritual — intimate, primal, and captivating. \r\n\r\nHer journey began with voice and composition before expanding into dance and flow. Now, behind the decks, the Blazing Sparrow channels her dancer spirit and love for vocals into DJ sets that are both grounding and transcendent. Her music bridges the pulsing underworld of bass with luminous melodic threads, inviting dancers and flow artists into a space of embodied liberation.\r\n\r\n", "start": "2025-08-16T02:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T04:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []
},{
"id": "d67a8207-673c-49fd-9414-00a9c27009b9", "place":{"id": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "name": "Spinning @ Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "name": "Tanec/Pohyb", "name_EN":"Dance/Movement", "color": "#E3D08C"}, "name": "From walking to dancing – Axis Syllabus Workshop", "name_EN": "From walking to dancing – Axis Syllabus Workshop", "name_Secondary": "Monika Silberbunt", "description": "IG: @Silberbunt Movements, Co sebou: Pohodlné oblečení, boty nebo naboso\r\nZačnu krátkým úvodem o osnově osy a hlavních zásadách chůze. Z tohoto teoretického či anatomického hlediska vstoupíme do světa pohybů a tance. Vyzkoušíme a pohneme se s informacemi. Cílem je, aby nám tyto informace pomáhaly v našem pohybu obecně. Mělo by pomáhat v každodenních pohybech i ve vysokých akrobatických dovednostech. Mělo by pomoci předcházet úrazům a dobře se hýbat až do vysokého věku. Osnova osnova je archiv, kde najdete informace o lidském těle v pohybu. Je to o mechanice a o tom, jak můžeme tyto okolnosti podpořit.", "description_EN": "IG: @Silberbunt Movements, What to bring: Comfortable clothes, shoes or barefoot\r\nI will start with a short introduction about the Axis Syllabus and the main walking principles. From this theoretical or anatomical point of view, we will enter the world of movements and dance. We will try out and move with the informations. The goal is, that these informations are helping us in our movements in general. It should help in daily life movements as well in high acrobatic skills. It should help to prevent for injuries as well to move good till old age. The Axis Syllabus is an archive where you can find information about the human body in motion. It is about the mechanics and how we can support these circumstances.", "start": "2025-08-15T16:30:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T18:00:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "typeId": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
},{
"id": "d6962175-61df-4a33-9cfa-83747e961bd4", "place":{"id": "5f32ef9b-d255-4420-95be-101ba551381c", "name": "Dock", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "Lydia Nexus", "name_EN": "Lydia Nexus", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Lydia Nexus je DJka z Německa známá svými dynamickými a pohlcujícími Psytrance sety. Od svého debutu v roce 2019 na flow jamech v Eindhovenu se stala známým jménem na holandské Psytrance scéně. Její festivalová vystoupení zahrnují renomovaná setkání jako Defqon.1, Hai in den Mai a Solstice Festival.\r\nKromě klubových a festivalových pódií je Lydia aktivní také v komunitě fire and flow arts, pravidelně hraje na flow spaces, fire meetingech a akcích jako Ignite Festival v Belgii.\r\nKromě toho připravuje sety na svém kanálu YouTube Fantasia Deep, kde prozkoumává chladnější, kmenové a downtempo zvuky.", "description_EN": "Lydia Nexus is a DJ from Germany known for her dynamic and immersive Psytrance sets. Since her debut in 2019 at flow jams in Eindhoven, she has become a familiar name in the Dutch Psytrance scene. Her festival appearances include renowned gatherings such as Defqon.1, Hai in den Mai, and Solstice Festival.\r\nBeyond the club and festival stages, Lydia is also active in the fire and flow arts community, regularly playing at flow spaces, fire gatherings, and events like Ignite Festival in Belgium.\r\nIn addition, she curates sets on her YouTube channel, Fantasia Deep, where she explores more chilled, tribal, and downtempo sounds.", "start": "2025-08-17T23:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-18T01:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "5f32ef9b-d255-4420-95be-101ba551381c", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []
},{
"id": "d84f42ba-36f5-46c5-9a9c-98a6a52f22c7", "place":{"id": "f15dabd2-1383-4338-8a1f-06686ae32ad9", "name": "Psylo Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "ae9f94a9-6dc0-479e-a445-1129a113627f", "name": "Juggling", "name_EN":"Juggling", "color": "#AEA994"}, "name": "Introduction to 8 rings & Isolations", "name_EN": "Introduction to 8 rings & Isolations", "name_Secondary": "Sisu", "description": "IG: @Sis_set_u, Co sebou: Sebe\r\nV závislosti na lidech bych učil začínající předení prstů, nebo izolaci se 2 8kroužky, nebo hru se 4 8kroužky.", "description_EN": "IG: @Sis_set_u, What to bring: Yourself\r\nDepending on the people I would teach beginning finger spinning, or isolation with 2 8rings, or playing with 4 8rings.", "start": "2025-08-16T15:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T16:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "f15dabd2-1383-4338-8a1f-06686ae32ad9", "typeId": "ae9f94a9-6dc0-479e-a445-1129a113627f", "tags": [{"id": "ba7623dc-5239-49d6-9b7c-5a56d8bf4b02", "name": "Začátečníci", "name_EN":"Beginner"}]
