"id": "d8c88d0e-df7c-45dc-8698-25a70f0f6870", "place":{"id": "11eec21d-ca1d-440c-9222-993490773ee7", "name": "Forest", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "2ed042bf-ef98-4293-8cf5-663007bd2911", "name": "Hoops", "name_EN":"Hoops", "color": "#ED76B0"}, "name": "Multi-Hoops", "name_EN": "Multi-Hoops", "name_Secondary": "Vicky", "description": "IG: @vicpster, Co sebou: Hula-hoop (půjdu s 10)\r\nCílem workshopu je prozkoumat možnosti přidání hula hoopů na tělo, sekvence a klasické pozice obruče se spoustou hula hoopů.", "description_EN": "IG: @vicpster, What to bring: Hula-hoop (I will go with 10)\r\nThe objective of the workshop is to search the possibilities of adding hula hoops to the body, sequences and hoop classic positions with a lot of hula hoops.", "start": "2025-08-16T13:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-16T15:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "11eec21d-ca1d-440c-9222-993490773ee7", "typeId": "2ed042bf-ef98-4293-8cf5-663007bd2911", "tags": [{"id": "35f1e8bc-7735-43fb-8caa-5d87e940a8b3", "name": "Masterclass", "name_EN":"Masterclass"}]
},{
"id": "da6b6b97-10ee-491e-bd48-c96353e150b2", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "0b6cd902-494b-454b-a291-aa0fb3a0f7d5", "name": "Rope dart", "name_EN":"Rope dart", "color": "#F7DF69"}, "name": "Cool kicks and how to find them", "name_EN": "Cool kicks and how to find them", "name_Secondary": "Stefan", "description": "IG: @hohenberger.stefan, Co sebou: lanovka\r\nVyzkoušíme si různé typy kopů s ropedartem, také nechám nahlédnout do svého myšlenkového procesu, jak si nastavit kopy zajímavým způsobem, a nasměrovat vás k tomu, abyste našli své vlastní fantazijní triky.", "description_EN": "IG: @hohenberger.stefan, What to bring: ropedart\r\nWe'll check out various types of kicks with the ropedart, I will also give an insight into my thought process of how to set up kicks in interesting ways, guiding you to find your own fancy tricks.", "start": "2025-08-15T13:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T15:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "0b6cd902-494b-454b-a291-aa0fb3a0f7d5", "tags": [{"id": "45d628ea-15e5-444b-a8a6-b624d86d002b", "name": "Středně pokročilí", "name_EN":"Intermediate"}]
},{
"id": "dd816b9d-5eee-4620-8319-d6bc4b354ca2", "place":{"id": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "name": "Spinning @ Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "name": "Tanec/Pohyb", "name_EN":"Dance/Movement", "color": "#E3D08C"}, "name": "Contemporary dance workshop", "name_EN": "Contemporary dance workshop", "name_Secondary": "Laura gil ballester", "description": "IG: @lau.movemeantlife, Co sebou: pohodlné oblečení\r\nTanec je víc než pohyb – je léčivý.\r\nProstřednictvím současného a street dance prozkoumáme prvky:\r\n🌍 Země – uzemnění a přežití\r\n💧 Voda – emoční tok\r\n🔥 Oheň – jádro a motivace\r\n🌬 Vzduch – dech a spojení\r\nJednoduchá cvičení pro uvolnění bloků, probuzení instinktu a opětovné spojení se svým plným já. Pojďme se společně hýbat, cítit a růst.", "description_EN": "IG: @lau.movemeantlife, What to bring: comfy clothes\r\nDance is more than movement — it’s healing.\r\nThrough contemporary and street dance, we’ll explore the elements:\r\n🌍 Earth – grounding & survival\r\n💧 Water – emotional flow\r\n🔥 Fire – core & motivation\r\n🌬 Air – breath & connection\r\nSimple exercises to release blocks, awaken instinct, and reconnect with your full self. Let’s move, feel, and grow together.", "start": "2025-08-17T13:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-17T15:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "typeId": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
},{
"id": "de065e34-e046-4265-ad54-594dadd970e3", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "eb6f9406-ec4e-4362-bc82-4a0e494fb189", "name": "Show", "name_EN":"Show", "color": "#e99998"}, "name": "Cirquencia - Don't be shy", "name_EN": "Cirquencia - Don't be shy", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Cirquencia byla založena na konci roku 2022 skupinou umělců a kreativců, kteří se setkali na svých cestách ve městě na severu Thajska jménem Pai. Různé skupiny umělců a žonglérů z celého světa se připojily ke stoupajícím vlnám kočovných umělců, kteří hledali místo, kde by našli komunitu, kde by se mohli společně učit a trénovat a ponořit se do svých médií během chladných zimních měsíců. Mezi tímto hnutím bylo velmi zvláštních několik jedinců, kteří věřili v sílu cirkusu, medicínu pohybu, a vytvořili prostor, kam mohl přijít kdokoli a naučit se hrát v průběhu let. Když globální pandemie tvrdě zasáhla všechny kreativce, tato skupina umělců, kteří se setkali v Pai, postrádala to, co společně našli: že cirkus, pohyb a kultura, kterou kolem něj vybudovali, jsou tam, kde se cítí nejvíce doma, nejvíce schopni být sami sebou. a tak se zrodila Cirquencia.\r\n", "description_EN": "Cirquencia was formed in the end of 2022, by a group of artists and creatives that met on their travels in a town in the north of Thailand, called Pai. Different groups of artists and jugglers from around the world had joined the rising tides of nomadic artists searching for somewhere to find community, to learn and train together, and to dive into their mediums during the cold winter months. Among this movement were a very special few individuals that believed in the power of circus, the medicine of movement, and created a space where anyone could come and learn how to perform through the years. When the global pandemic hit hard for all creatives, this group of artists who met in Pai missed what they had found together: that circus, movement and the culture they had built around it was where they felt the most at home, the most able to be themselves. and thus, Cirquencia was born.\r\n", "start": "2025-08-14T20:00:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-14T21:00:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "eb6f9406-ec4e-4362-bc82-4a0e494fb189", "tags": []
},{
