"id": "e1d65966-904c-4d05-a175-86ccec5837b6", "place":{"id": "5f32ef9b-d255-4420-95be-101ba551381c", "name": "Dock", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "Nulleamai", "name_EN": "Nulleamai", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Obvykle rád zapaluje, tentokrát se svým \"nesmyslným psytrancem\" rozstříkne benzin na taneční parket. Tohle není Dj, kterého potřebujete, ale ten, kterého si zasloužíte! ", "description_EN": "Usually he likes to put things on fire, this time he's going to spray gasoline on the dancefloor with his \"nonsense psytrance\". This is not the Dj that you need, but the one that you deserve! ", "start": "2025-08-18T01:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-18T02:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "5f32ef9b-d255-4420-95be-101ba551381c", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []
},{"id": "e3a03c57-3e7d-4d37-9307-6c728290dd55", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "Aeremia", "name_EN": "Aeremia", "name_Secondary": "", "description": ".", "description_EN": ".", "start": "2025-08-15T02:00:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T03:00:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []},{
"id": "e448f744-35cd-4b44-9b04-ae96e448375c", "place":{"id": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "name": "Spinning @ Tent", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "name": "Tanec/Pohyb", "name_EN":"Dance/Movement", "color": "#E3D08C"}, "name": "Waistline Technique- female Dancehall", "name_EN": "Waistline Technique- female Dancehall", "name_Secondary": "Jules Dandelion", "description": "IG: @julesdandelion, Co sebou: Sebe a pohodlné oblečení\r\nTechnika pasu – kyčle překračují twerking. Objevte bohatou slovní zásobu pohybu kyčle v ženském Dancehallu! Tento workshop se ponoří do techniky pasu a prozkoumá, jak izolovat, ovládat a proudit boky. Rozebereme charakteristické pohyby a naučíme se, jak správná technika vytváří čistý, expresivní pohyb – ukážeme, že hip shaking je mnohem víc než jen twerking. Očekávejte zábavné a posilující sezení se základy zakořeněnými v rytmu, vědomí těla a Dancehall kultuře. Všechny úrovně vítány!", "description_EN": "IG: @julesdandelion, What to bring: Yourself and comfy clothes\r\nWaistline Technique – Hip Moves Beyond Twerking. Discover the rich vocabulary of hip movement in female Dancehall! This workshop dives into waistline technique, exploring how to isolate, control, and flow with your hips. We’ll break down signature moves and learn how proper technique creates clean, expressive motion — showing that hip shaking is about far more than just twerking. Expect a fun, empowering session with foundations rooted in rhythm, body awareness, and Dancehall culture. All levels welcome!", "start": "2025-08-15T15:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-15T16:30:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "2ed3e877-836d-4f11-9965-ff31c9ccb455", "typeId": "8faa748d-f704-492f-b05a-8bb89c9a522a", "tags": [{"id": "eebd10bd-28bb-4444-8257-45487aba7c35", "name": "Všechny úrovně", "name_EN":"Open Level"}]
},{"id": "e4f9ba3a-51a4-4d6f-8d2c-881ec97c5039", "place":{"id": "5f32ef9b-d255-4420-95be-101ba551381c", "name": "Dock", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "Skliba", "name_EN": "Skliba", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "DJ Skliba", "description_EN": "DJ Skliba", "start": "2025-08-18T04:00:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-18T06:30:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "5f32ef9b-d255-4420-95be-101ba551381c", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []},{
"id": "e571ee7e-3fe9-4e6e-8c99-c5f597f3e6dc", "place":{"id": "11eec21d-ca1d-440c-9222-993490773ee7", "name": "Forest", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "64f26ee0-a3e5-422f-9a69-145c81e2d1b9", "name": "ALL PROPS", "name_EN":"ALL PROPS", "color": ""}, "name": "Prop Dance", "name_EN": "Prop Dance", "name_Secondary": "Jules Dandelion", "description": "IG: @julesdandelion, Co sebou: funguje jakákoliv rekvizita, ale jednodušší je mít statické rekvizity a jednu pro každou ruku\r\nV tomto workshopu prozkoumáme, jak si vytvořit svůj vlastní slovník rekvizitních tanečních pohybů – kde se manipulace s předměty setkává s tancem. Pohyb rekvizitového tance spojuje taneční krok s manipulačním trikem, jehož výsledkem je dynamické spojení pohybu a plynutí. Ponoříme se do výzvy koordinace těla a podpěry, přijmeme trochu přetížení mozku, když překonáme komfortní zóny. Nakonec to všechno spojíme do krátké kombo nebo volné sekvence sestavené z pohybů, které jsme společně vytvořili.", "description_EN": "IG: @julesdandelion, What to bring: any prop works, but easier to have static props and one for each hand\r\nIn this workshop, we’ll explore how to create your own vocabulary of prop dance moves — where object manipulation meets dance. A prop dance move blends a dance step with a manipulation trick, resulting in a dynamic fusion of movement and flow. We’ll dive into the challenge of coordinating body and prop, embracing a bit of brain overload as we push beyond comfort zones. By the end, we’ll put it all together into a short combo or freestyle sequence built from the moves we’ve created together.", "start": "2025-08-14T15:00:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-14T16:30:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "11eec21d-ca1d-440c-9222-993490773ee7", "typeId": "64f26ee0-a3e5-422f-9a69-145c81e2d1b9", "tags": [{"id": "35f1e8bc-7735-43fb-8caa-5d87e940a8b3", "name": "Masterclass", "name_EN":"Masterclass"}]
},{"id": "e6356181-c80f-4684-9a96-bf615089100d", "place":{"id": "7f56de3c-ae91-4bc3-8d2c-a9b4fd401b18", "name": "Tchaiovna", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "Beatbox live looping - Kristof & Jan elf", "name_EN": "Beatbox live looping - Kristof & Jan elf", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Beatbox live looping - Kristof & Jan elf", "description_EN": "Beatbox live looping - Kristof & Jan elf", "start": "2025-08-17T22:30:00+02:00", "end": "2025-08-18T00:00:00+02:00", "image": "", "placeId": "7f56de3c-ae91-4bc3-8d2c-a9b4fd401b18", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []},{
"id": "e86ddffc-5f3a-4f16-a324-c6f0b4f06030", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "Liquid Wallah", "name_EN": "Liquid Wallah", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Se dvěma Roztočskými vystoupeními a řadou ohnivých setů na konvencích se tento DJ poslední rok ponořil hluboko do back-to-back, vypiloval své řemeslo a vybudoval eklektický, groovově vydatný zvuk. Loni zabalili bunkr v Roztoči, takže si všichni odskočili a dali si basu. Ať už se těla pohybují na tanečním parketu nebo se stávají divnými v prostoru ohně, jsou zpět a připraveni znovu doručit.", "description_EN": "With two Roztoč appearances and a string of fiery sets at conventions under their belt, this DJ has spent the last year diving deep into back-to-backs, sharpening their craft, and building an eclectic, groove-hearty sound. Last year, they packed out the bunker at Roztoč, making everyone bounce and get their fix of bass. Whether it’s making bodies move in the dance floor or getting weird in the fire space, they’re back and ready to deliver once again.", "start": "2025-08-17T23:30:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-18T01:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []
