"id": "f22277f1-a7d1-4bff-8136-b11a8b7624d8", "place":{"id": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "name": "Fire Space", "name_EN":"", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "","description_EN": "", "start": null, "end":null, "image": "", "placeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tags": []}, "type":{"id": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "name": "DJ", "name_EN":"DJ", "color": "#c9daf8"}, "name": "Lydia Nexus", "name_EN": "Lydia Nexus", "name_Secondary": "", "description": "Lydia Nexus je DJka z Německa známá svými dynamickými a pohlcujícími Psytrance sety. Od svého debutu v roce 2019 na flow jamech v Eindhovenu se stala známým jménem na holandské Psytrance scéně. Její festivalová vystoupení zahrnují renomovaná setkání jako Defqon.1, Hai in den Mai a Solstice Festival.\r\n\r\nKromě klubových a festivalových pódií je Lydia aktivní také v komunitě fire and flow arts, pravidelně hraje na flow spaces, fire meetingech a akcích jako Ignite Festival v Belgii. Kromě toho připravuje sety na svém kanálu YouTube Fantasia Deep, kde prozkoumává chladnější, kmenové a downtempo zvuky.\r\n", "description_EN": "Lydia Nexus is a DJ from Germany known for her dynamic and immersive Psytrance sets. Since her debut in 2019 at flow jams in Eindhoven, she has become a familiar name in the Dutch Psytrance scene. Her festival appearances include renowned gatherings such as Defqon.1, Hai in den Mai, and Solstice Festival.\r\n\r\nBeyond the club and festival stages, Lydia is also active in the fire and flow arts community, regularly playing at flow spaces, fire gatherings, and events like Ignite Festival in Belgium. In addition, she curates sets on her YouTube channel, Fantasia Deep, where she explores more chilled, tribal, and downtempo sounds.\r\n", "start": "2025-08-17T04:00:00.0000000+02:00", "end": "2025-08-17T06:00:00.0000000+02:00", "image": null, "placeId": "23c4fbee-6ebb-4b05-ad05-a5ad8d2d5022", "typeId": "caa27447-9336-402c-b8f7-b00b8b5476f8", "tags": []
